(2960956, 416954, 36403, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge - 2 <br/>Lighting/Processing - 1 <br/>Composition - 1 <br/>Overall Impression - 1 <br/>"WOW" factor - 0 <br/>Score: 5<br/> <br/>Did you use your flash here?  The objects in the forefront seem to be more harshly lit and the background isn''t well lit at all.  I''m guessing this looks better as a B&amp;W, so good call on that.  Still, good idea, just needs a little tweaking.</td>', 'Meets Challenge - 2 Lighting/Processing - 1 Composition - 1 Overall Impression - 1 "WOW" factor - 0 Score: 5 Did you use your flash here?  The objects in the forefront seem to be more harshly lit and the background isn''t well lit at all.  I''m guessing this looks better as a B&W, so good call on that.  Still, good idea, just needs a little tweaking.', '2006-10-25 10:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
