(2961258, 417021, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the windmill in the background.  Seems to me you''re selling the sunset a bit too strong here as the field is rapidly fading into darkness.  Maybe if you''d taken this photo 10 minutes earlier you could have had both?  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the windmill in the background.  Seems to me you''re selling the sunset a bit too strong here as the field is rapidly fading into darkness.  Maybe if you''d taken this photo 10 minutes earlier you could have had both?  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-25 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
