(2961653, 417004, 53964, '<td valign="top">This is my only 9. The colour, lighting, choice of angle and crop all work together to give beauty and interest beyond only how the seat feels under our butts while we concentrate on the game.</td>', 'This is my only 9. The colour, lighting, choice of angle and crop all work together to give beauty and interest beyond only how the seat feels under our butts while we concentrate on the game.', '2006-10-25 13:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
