(2961661, 416402, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice, even exposure.  This has a very static feel to it.  The feeling of emptiness might have been enhanced if this was taken at dusk or dawn.</td>', 'Nice, even exposure.  This has a very static feel to it.  The feeling of emptiness might have been enhanced if this was taken at dusk or dawn.', '2006-10-25 14:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961662, 414743, 30049, '<td valign="top">Jump roping is a sport?  Guess that makes the venue a wide range of choices then, eh?  :D  The colors are interesting, as are the lines.  Focus isn''t quite there all the way thru.  Still not sure about the challenge connection.  Oh well.  Good luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Jump roping is a sport?  Guess that makes the venue a wide range of choices then, eh?  :D  The colors are interesting, as are the lines.  Focus isn''t quite there all the way thru.  Still not sure about the challenge connection.  Oh well.  Good luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-25 14:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961665, 414488, 53964, '<td valign="top">The garbage is what completes this shot :)</td>', 'The garbage is what completes this shot :)', '2006-10-25 14:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961674, 416297, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a fun photo of, wait, a person?  Hmmm.  I need to revisit those challenge details.  Oh yeah - there they are.  Well, I guess this could one of the people that went home and is now playing a video game.  Wait, that would mean he left the sporting venue then.  Isn''t this fun?  :D<br/> <br/>Bottom line.  Cool pic, not sure if it''s right for the challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is a fun photo of, wait, a person?  Hmmm.  I need to revisit those challenge details.  Oh yeah - there they are.  Well, I guess this could one of the people that went home and is now playing a video game.  Wait, that would mean he left the sporting venue then.  Isn''t this fun?  :D Bottom line.  Cool pic, not sure if it''s right for the challenge.  Good luck.', '2006-10-25 14:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961677, 417000, 30049, '<td valign="top">What is "It"?  Don''t see the sporting venue here.  Sumo wrestling?  :D</td>', 'What is "It"?  Don''t see the sporting venue here.  Sumo wrestling?  :D', '2006-10-25 14:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961681, 415968, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Hope they took their compasses with them.  Those woods look fairly thick!  :D  Good idea and take on this challenge.  Best of luck to you.</td>', 'Cute.  Hope they took their compasses with them.  Those woods look fairly thick!  :D  Good idea and take on this challenge.  Best of luck to you.', '2006-10-25 14:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961682, 416997, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot from a purely abstract point of view.  The lines, shapes, and colors are intriguing.  While this is obviously a playing field os some sort, though, I don''t necessarily get a feeling for the story you are trying to tell about it.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot from a purely abstract point of view.  The lines, shapes, and colors are intriguing.  While this is obviously a playing field os some sort, though, I don''t necessarily get a feeling for the story you are trying to tell about it.', '2006-10-25 14:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961687, 415909, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is a beautifully composed shot.  Strong lines and good use of contrast.  I like the way the highlights in the sky split the uprights.</td>', 'This is a beautifully composed shot.  Strong lines and good use of contrast.  I like the way the highlights in the sky split the uprights.', '2006-10-25 14:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961693, 414680, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice.  That soccer ball was throwing me off for a minute.  Thought it was some HUGE medicine ball or something near the far wall!  :D  It may be old but seems well kept.  Nice POV for this photo.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice.  That soccer ball was throwing me off for a minute.  Thought it was some HUGE medicine ball or something near the far wall!  :D  It may be old but seems well kept.  Nice POV for this photo.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-25 14:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961695, 416228, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  I wish the gentleman was a little better lit, but that''s just a nit.</td>', 'Nicely composed.  I wish the gentleman was a little better lit, but that''s just a nit.', '2006-10-25 14:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
