(2961837, 416785, 30508, '<td valign="top">I think you had a nice concept and a good place to work here, but something just misses the mark.  You''ve used a longer exposer to get the blur of people leaving which I like, but because they are so far from you it is hard to make out that this is what you intended.  Also, you have a nice, dramatic sky to work with, but it seems a bit blurry.  I think getting closer to the action and underexposing a little bit with a slightly shorter shutter speed would have improved this.</td>', 'I think you had a nice concept and a good place to work here, but something just misses the mark.  You''ve used a longer exposer to get the blur of people leaving which I like, but because they are so far from you it is hard to make out that this is what you intended.  Also, you have a nice, dramatic sky to work with, but it seems a bit blurry.  I think getting closer to the action and underexposing a little bit with a slightly shorter shutter speed would have improved this.', '2006-10-25 14:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961853, 415993, 30508, '<td valign="top">Wondeful.  I''ll expect to see this on the front page.</td>', 'Wondeful.  I''ll expect to see this on the front page.', '2006-10-25 14:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
