(2961902, 416753, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey that''s cool.  I''ve never been to a Regatta race.  Hadn''t thought about how it was viewed.  The sky cooperated for you quite nicely.  Adds some nice drama to the photo.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hey that''s cool.  I''ve never been to a Regatta race.  Hadn''t thought about how it was viewed.  The sky cooperated for you quite nicely.  Adds some nice drama to the photo.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-25 14:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
