(2961910, 415704, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute and clever all rolled into one.  :D  Great idea for the challenge.  Only thing I''d suggest is making sure you have your image level being posting up for the challenge.  It''s leaning left.  Good luck.</td>', 'Cute and clever all rolled into one.  :D  Great idea for the challenge.  Only thing I''d suggest is making sure you have your image level being posting up for the challenge.  It''s leaning left.  Good luck.', '2006-10-25 14:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961921, 416846, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey, what''s she still doing there?  Besides posing for the camera that is.  :)  Personally, I thought the challenge called for no people in the photo. Hmmm.  Regarding the image, it seems like the focus is locked in at the handrail past her.  She seems a bit soft.  Good luck.</td>', 'Hey, what''s she still doing there?  Besides posing for the camera that is.  :)  Personally, I thought the challenge called for no people in the photo. Hmmm.  Regarding the image, it seems like the focus is locked in at the handrail past her.  She seems a bit soft.  Good luck.', '2006-10-25 14:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961924, 416298, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture here.  Nice color and sharp.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely capture here.  Nice color and sharp.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-25 14:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961927, 415182, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ummm...those are players aren''t they?  Where''s the empty field/stadium/sporting venue, etc...?</td>', 'Ummm...those are players aren''t they?  Where''s the empty field/stadium/sporting venue, etc...?', '2006-10-25 14:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961930, 416129, 30049, '<td valign="top">Uh-oh.  Going to get hammered a bit for having a person in your photograph I think.  You know, the whole "after the players and people have gone home" bit.  This would have made a wonderful pattern abstract type shot.  It''s a cool image as is, just going to have difficulty with the DNMC group...  Best of luck to you.</td>', 'Uh-oh.  Going to get hammered a bit for having a person in your photograph I think.  You know, the whole "after the players and people have gone home" bit.  This would have made a wonderful pattern abstract type shot.  It''s a cool image as is, just going to have difficulty with the DNMC group...  Best of luck to you.', '2006-10-25 14:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961932, 416397, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s a very cool and fun idea this school has.  :)  The image is fun because of the subject.  It''s a bit grainy and seems a little fuzzy.  Were you using a tripod for this?  Anyway.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'That''s a very cool and fun idea this school has.  :)  The image is fun because of the subject.  It''s a bit grainy and seems a little fuzzy.  Were you using a tripod for this?  Anyway.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-25 14:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961945, 415558, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oh man.  Were you in a hurry?  This had BIG potential.  Needs to be focused first...</td>', 'Oh man.  Were you in a hurry?  This had BIG potential.  Needs to be focused first...', '2006-10-25 14:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
