(2962078, 416129, 39670, '<td valign="top">Love the pic but it did say "afer everybody had left" so i can only give it a 7 sorry id have loved to have give it 9.</td>', 'Love the pic but it did say "afer everybody had left" so i can only give it a 7 sorry id have loved to have give it 9.', '2006-10-25 15:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
