(2962325, 416931, 65498, '<td valign="top">I like this one.. but am not sure if the shallow DOF appeals</td>', 'I like this one.. but am not sure if the shallow DOF appeals', '2006-10-25 17:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962327, 416973, 66127, '<td valign="top">what happened to his arm?</td>', 'what happened to his arm?', '2006-10-25 17:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962330, 415543, 65498, '<td valign="top">this is a good concept. maybe a white tabletop and top view could have added more impact</td>', 'this is a good concept. maybe a white tabletop and top view could have added more impact', '2006-10-25 17:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962333, 415103, 65025, '<td valign="top">cool color, but I can''t tell it''s at a sporting venue.</td>', 'cool color, but I can''t tell it''s at a sporting venue.', '2006-10-25 17:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962334, 415814, 65498, '<td valign="top">nice one here.</td>', 'nice one here.', '2006-10-25 17:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962341, 417028, 65025, '<td valign="top">I wish I could tell there was just a sports game there.</td>', 'I wish I could tell there was just a sports game there.', '2006-10-25 17:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962342, 416300, 66127, '<td valign="top">beer pong?</td>', 'beer pong?', '2006-10-25 17:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962343, 416785, 65025, '<td valign="top">Gotta love slow shutter speeds!  but there are people in it, is the only problem.</td>', 'Gotta love slow shutter speeds!  but there are people in it, is the only problem.', '2006-10-25 17:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962345, 415543, 62095, '<td valign="top">I have a chess set similar to this one.  <br/> <br/>I like this idea, I just find the focus / sharpness? to be a little off what it needs to be.</td>', 'I have a chess set similar to this one.   I like this idea, I just find the focus / sharpness? to be a little off what it needs to be.', '2006-10-25 17:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962349, 416198, 62095, '<td valign="top">Very good. Original.</td>', 'Very good. Original.', '2006-10-25 17:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962362, 413418, 62095, '<td valign="top">Well. I have to say that I don''t understand this photo at all in relation to the challenge.  "photograph a sporting venue after the game is over" it said. So here we have a photo of a little girl.  I mean, she has impressive eyes and everything, but do they have little sports stadia in them? No, I think they''re just eyes.  SO I think, well, maybe we''re interpreting the challenge laterally - like, after a child''s game - maybe she''s been playing and is now looking up all innocent and saying "I didn''t do it".  That could be it.  But she''s still not a sporting venue.<br/> <br/>Great photo.  One that could have done well in the free study.  I can''t in good conscience give it a high score in this challenge.</td>', 'Well. I have to say that I don''t understand this photo at all in relation to the challenge.  "photograph a sporting venue after the game is over" it said. So here we have a photo of a little girl.  I mean, she has impressive eyes and everything, but do they have little sports stadia in them? No, I think they''re just eyes.  SO I think, well, maybe we''re interpreting the challenge laterally - like, after a child''s game - maybe she''s been playing and is now looking up all innocent and saying "I didn''t do it".  That could be it.  But she''s still not a sporting venue. Great photo.  One that could have done well in the free study.  I can''t in good conscience give it a high score in this challenge.', '2006-10-25 17:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962364, 415450, 62095, '<td valign="top">Excellent.</td>', 'Excellent.', '2006-10-25 17:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962369, 417000, 62095, '<td valign="top">Oh my god.  I literally spent a whole year completing one of these stupid sudoko puzzle books from cover to cover hundreds of the silly puzzles, night after night before going to bed.  Because I can be so OC about these things I had to complete the whole book in order without any help, so obviously it took ages.  Now I''m completely sick of the stupid things and will probably never do another one again.  As such, I relate to your photo and your title and give this a 9.</td>', 'Oh my god.  I literally spent a whole year completing one of these stupid sudoko puzzle books from cover to cover hundreds of the silly puzzles, night after night before going to bed.  Because I can be so OC about these things I had to complete the whole book in order without any help, so obviously it took ages.  Now I''m completely sick of the stupid things and will probably never do another one again.  As such, I relate to your photo and your title and give this a 9.', '2006-10-25 17:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962372, 416841, 62095, '<td valign="top">Well. This fits the challenge if you can consider your living room as a "sporting venue".</td>', 'Well. This fits the challenge if you can consider your living room as a "sporting venue".', '2006-10-25 17:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962377, 417013, 18219, '<td valign="top">it''s nearly too dark.<br/>but not quite.<br/>and the low point of view is a big plus.</td>', 'it''s nearly too dark.but not quite.and the low point of view is a big plus.', '2006-10-25 17:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962378, 416297, 18219, '<td valign="top">nice portrait.</td>', 'nice portrait.', '2006-10-25 17:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962386, 416281, 62095, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh out loud.  Fantastic creativity has gone into this shot.  This is a bit like TheSaj''s pirate ship shot in the ducky challenge in that I get a sense that a fair amount of time has gone in to placing all those tiny little balls and stuff and then people will probably look at this shot and pick holes with it and vote it down well low for no particular good reason, which really narks me because then you get entrants that come in on the first page of challenges that bear no real relationship to the challenge at all but people have voted up because they are technically great.  Yeah, sure they are, but where''s the imagination, huh?  This shot may be a tad lacking in technical brilliance, but it''s a great invention. 9</td>', 'This made me laugh out loud.  Fantastic creativity has gone into this shot.  This is a bit like TheSaj''s pirate ship shot in the ducky challenge in that I get a sense that a fair amount of time has gone in to placing all those tiny little balls and stuff and then people will probably look at this shot and pick holes with it and vote it down well low for no particular good reason, which really narks me because then you get entrants that come in on the first page of challenges that bear no real relationship to the challenge at all but people have voted up because they are technically great.  Yeah, sure they are, but where''s the imagination, huh?  This shot may be a tad lacking in technical brilliance, but it''s a great invention. 9', '2006-10-25 17:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962387, 416783, 62095, '<td valign="top">Classically I would have expected the 19th hole to refer to a drinking establishment that the golfers retire to.  But whatever you fancy, I suppose.</td>', 'Classically I would have expected the 19th hole to refer to a drinking establishment that the golfers retire to.  But whatever you fancy, I suppose.', '2006-10-25 17:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962388, 416858, 62095, '<td valign="top">Quite.</td>', 'Quite.', '2006-10-25 17:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962389, 415704, 62095, '<td valign="top">Fast little thing eh?</td>', 'Fast little thing eh?', '2006-10-25 17:40:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2962392, 416145, 55956, '<td valign="top">Touchdown but on the foreground there is a track. perhaps the football field is too much on the background and far from the main subject(or better, that than I understand to be the main subject). the photograph is good, with a good composition and colours.</td>', 'Touchdown but on the foreground there is a track. perhaps the football field is too much on the background and far from the main subject(or better, that than I understand to be the main subject). the photograph is good, with a good composition and colours.', '2006-10-25 17:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962403, 416000, 62095, '<td valign="top">As a study in shallow DOF it has some merit, but I''m really struggling to pull the essence of a sporting venue from the middle of this shot.  Maybe there''s some wild abstract link that binds everything together, something like the force does in Star Wars.</td>', 'As a study in shallow DOF it has some merit, but I''m really struggling to pull the essence of a sporting venue from the middle of this shot.  Maybe there''s some wild abstract link that binds everything together, something like the force does in Star Wars.', '2006-10-25 17:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962404, 416983, 55956, '<td valign="top">really a good photo. perhaps a bit tilted on the the right but with a great atmosphere.</td>', 'really a good photo. perhaps a bit tilted on the the right but with a great atmosphere.', '2006-10-25 17:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962407, 414589, 62095, '<td valign="top">Yeah.  My first instinct was to cross this one off and say "too dark", but then actually it''s just the right darkness, like turning the lights out after the show sort of darkness. Impressive.</td>', 'Yeah.  My first instinct was to cross this one off and say "too dark", but then actually it''s just the right darkness, like turning the lights out after the show sort of darkness. Impressive.', '2006-10-25 17:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962411, 416297, 62095, '<td valign="top">I suppose it has comic shot value, but this guy really isn''t a "sporting venue".</td>', 'I suppose it has comic shot value, but this guy really isn''t a "sporting venue".', '2006-10-25 17:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962415, 413603, 62095, '<td valign="top">I''ll see your field with trees in, and raise you a sporting venue.</td>', 'I''ll see your field with trees in, and raise you a sporting venue.', '2006-10-25 17:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962419, 416505, 55956, '<td valign="top">a title from a famous film I think :)</td>', 'a title from a famous film I think :)', '2006-10-25 17:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962437, 416756, 55956, '<td valign="top">to be in the contest or not to be in the contest. the field is empty and the ant on the ball seems to prove it but perhaps the situation can be uncertain. I think that the composition isn''t perfect because the ball is too much in the middle. the colours are good.</td>', 'to be in the contest or not to be in the contest. the field is empty and the ant on the ball seems to prove it but perhaps the situation can be uncertain. I think that the composition isn''t perfect because the ball is too much in the middle. the colours are good.', '2006-10-25 17:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962454, 416847, 55956, '<td valign="top">good image, good symmetry,good colours but I see not the post game. the situation can be in a normal day</td>', 'good image, good symmetry,good colours but I see not the post game. the situation can be in a normal day', '2006-10-25 18:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962460, 413418, 55956, '<td valign="top">very good portrait but out of the contest.</td>', 'very good portrait but out of the contest.', '2006-10-25 18:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962462, 416198, 63944, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, well contrasted!</td>', 'I love the colors, well contrasted!', '2006-10-25 18:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962465, 415543, 63944, '<td valign="top">It is a bit grainy, but a well set up shot</td>', 'It is a bit grainy, but a well set up shot', '2006-10-25 18:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962467, 416757, 63944, '<td valign="top">It is a bit dark, but I love the sky background</td>', 'It is a bit dark, but I love the sky background', '2006-10-25 18:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962473, 414424, 63944, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast of dark vs light seats!</td>', 'I love the contrast of dark vs light seats!', '2006-10-25 18:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962474, 415316, 55956, '<td valign="top">I suppose that the home loss the match :)</td>', 'I suppose that the home loss the match :)', '2006-10-25 18:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962476, 416239, 63944, '<td valign="top">great shot, the black and white adds to the feel of the picture</td>', 'great shot, the black and white adds to the feel of the picture', '2006-10-25 18:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962487, 415543, 55956, '<td valign="top">mmmm the angle of view isn''t very good. there is a cut on the left and on the field there isn''t the white king and the position of other pieces is impossible. good the colours and sharpness.</td>', 'mmmm the angle of view isn''t very good. there is a cut on the left and on the field there isn''t the white king and the position of other pieces is impossible. good the colours and sharpness.', '2006-10-25 18:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962501, 415909, 47541, '<td valign="top">This does have a nice moody feel to it in the sky but the ground (and the scoreboard in particular) is a bit dark.  I''m guessing you couldn''t do much about that given the time of day and the editing rules.  Overall a pleasing image: 6</td>', 'This does have a nice moody feel to it in the sky but the ground (and the scoreboard in particular) is a bit dark.  I''m guessing you couldn''t do much about that given the time of day and the editing rules.  Overall a pleasing image: 6', '2006-10-25 18:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962505, 415989, 63944, '<td valign="top">What game was the scare crow in?</td>', 'What game was the scare crow in?', '2006-10-25 18:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962509, 416214, 47541, '<td valign="top">Good idea to try and use the seats as a patttern.  The sun reflecting on them is a bit distracting as the eye doesnt know if it should look at the reflection or the line formed by the edge of the seats: 5</td>', 'Good idea to try and use the seats as a patttern.  The sun reflecting on them is a bit distracting as the eye doesnt know if it should look at the reflection or the line formed by the edge of the seats: 5', '2006-10-25 18:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962533, 416783, 55956, '<td valign="top">I don''t know very well the golf rules but I can''t see the post game in this image, the title for me is misterious(what means?). On the photo, the tree on the left is distracting perhaps with another cut you can obtain a better image.</td>', 'I don''t know very well the golf rules but I can''t see the post game in this image, the title for me is misterious(what means?). On the photo, the tree on the left is distracting perhaps with another cut you can obtain a better image.', '2006-10-25 18:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962536, 415989, 47541, '<td valign="top">I can''t see how this relates to the topic at all.  The image itself is nice enough (5 or 6) with good bokeh (wrong challenge perhaps?) but DNMC=3</td>', 'I can''t see how this relates to the topic at all.  The image itself is nice enough (5 or 6) with good bokeh (wrong challenge perhaps?) but DNMC=3', '2006-10-25 18:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962547, 416124, 47541, '<td valign="top">This meets challenge but there are a few things "wrong" with this image.  The composition doesnt draw my eye to the fence, the shadow gets my attention.  I''d like to see much less ground at the right and a bit more at the left so my eye ran along the fence as I view the image: 4</td>', 'This meets challenge but there are a few things "wrong" with this image.  The composition doesnt draw my eye to the fence, the shadow gets my attention.  I''d like to see much less ground at the right and a bit more at the left so my eye ran along the fence as I view the image: 4', '2006-10-25 18:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962548, 415416, 55956, '<td valign="top">the image seems have a strange perspective, but a good image.</td>', 'the image seems have a strange perspective, but a good image.', '2006-10-25 18:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962557, 416129, 47541, '<td valign="top">OK, I like the image.  The red in a sea of blue is good and the only thing I can fault is that maybe the person should be a bit lower.  I''d give this a 7 but as the challenge said "the players and people have gone home" I''ll DNMC it=3 - sorry :(</td>', 'OK, I like the image.  The red in a sea of blue is good and the only thing I can fault is that maybe the person should be a bit lower.  I''d give this a 7 but as the challenge said "the players and people have gone home" I''ll DNMC it=3 - sorry :(', '2006-10-25 18:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962562, 416954, 47541, '<td valign="top">A good concept at it meets challenge.  I like the unique POV but I think that it is that POV that also hurts this image.  By shooting from low the background details like the posts get lost in the sky a bit.  I also feel the lighting is a bit harsh on the boots: 6</td>', 'A good concept at it meets challenge.  I like the unique POV but I think that it is that POV that also hurts this image.  By shooting from low the background details like the posts get lost in the sky a bit.  I also feel the lighting is a bit harsh on the boots: 6', '2006-10-25 18:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962565, 413418, 47541, '<td valign="top">An OK image in itself but I fail to see the link with the topic.  A 6 or 7 normally but DNMC=3</td>', 'An OK image in itself but I fail to see the link with the topic.  A 6 or 7 normally but DNMC=3', '2006-10-25 18:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962571, 416239, 47541, '<td valign="top">Not a unique concept but this is well executed.  There is a lot going on in the frame but I''m not too distracted from the bat and gear.  A tiny bit cropped off the right would help: 7</td>', 'Not a unique concept but this is well executed.  There is a lot going on in the frame but I''m not too distracted from the bat and gear.  A tiny bit cropped off the right would help: 7', '2006-10-25 18:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
