(2963038, 416198, 58160, '<td valign="top">For me, there isn''t anything in this shot that says "game" or "sporting venue".  The cups in the street could just as easily be outside a frat house.  Compositionally, I like the way everything lines up, although I would have been tempted to remove the box and the bit of cup in the upper left, as I find them distracting.  Processing on this must have been touch, since the cups are so saturated (over, in some spots) and the rest is so bland.</td>', 'For me, there isn''t anything in this shot that says "game" or "sporting venue".  The cups in the street could just as easily be outside a frat house.  Compositionally, I like the way everything lines up, although I would have been tempted to remove the box and the bit of cup in the upper left, as I find them distracting.  Processing on this must have been touch, since the cups are so saturated (over, in some spots) and the rest is so bland.', '2006-10-25 20:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963041, 416145, 64928, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I almost missed the scoreboard.</td>', 'Very pretty.  I almost missed the scoreboard.', '2006-10-25 20:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963044, 416753, 31403, '<td valign="top">sure is tidy for the races just getting over!  :-)<br/> <br/>You do what you gotta, I understand.<br/> <br/>Love the brown tones here with the fall colors.</td>', 'sure is tidy for the races just getting over!  :-) You do what you gotta, I understand. Love the brown tones here with the fall colors.', '2006-10-25 20:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
