(2963053, 415182, 65498, '<td valign="top">beautiful capture</td>', 'beautiful capture', '2006-10-25 20:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963059, 415704, 31829, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 10<br/>Lighting/Processing: 7<br/>Composition: 5 (I''d like to see the zamboni less blurred)<br/>Overall Impression: 5<br/>"WOW" factor: 4<br/> <br/>Average Score: 6.2</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 10Lighting/Processing: 7Composition: 5 (I''d like to see the zamboni less blurred)Overall Impression: 5"WOW" factor: 4 Average Score: 6.2', '2006-10-25 20:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963063, 416973, 58160, '<td valign="top">Not being familar with wherever this was taken, there''s nothing in this picture that indicates sports to me, although if this is outside a stadium, clearly there are some people who haven''t gone home yet.  I would have liked to see a bit more contrast, as the whole image looks washed out to me.  It looks to me as if the whole image is canted down to the right a bit, which I find distracting.</td>', 'Not being familar with wherever this was taken, there''s nothing in this picture that indicates sports to me, although if this is outside a stadium, clearly there are some people who haven''t gone home yet.  I would have liked to see a bit more contrast, as the whole image looks washed out to me.  It looks to me as if the whole image is canted down to the right a bit, which I find distracting.', '2006-10-25 20:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963066, 416198, 31829, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 10<br/>Lighting/Processing: 5<br/>Composition: 6<br/>Overall Impression: 4<br/>"WOW" factor: 3<br/> <br/>Average Score: 5.6</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 10Lighting/Processing: 5Composition: 6Overall Impression: 4"WOW" factor: 3 Average Score: 5.6', '2006-10-25 20:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963067, 416108, 64928, '<td valign="top">Looks like a food magazine picture, but kind of a stretch to meet the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like a food magazine picture, but kind of a stretch to meet the challenge.', '2006-10-25 20:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963071, 416298, 53964, '<td valign="top">My eye first is grabbed by the "O" but then moves to the top, drawn by the light, and travels slowly down to the gate, where I find myself carried through, where I imagine I would find the expanse of stadium opening before me. It''s a shot that looks good at first glance but is so much better when time is taken to absorb and feel all the nuances.</td>', 'My eye first is grabbed by the "O" but then moves to the top, drawn by the light, and travels slowly down to the gate, where I find myself carried through, where I imagine I would find the expanse of stadium opening before me. It''s a shot that looks good at first glance but is so much better when time is taken to absorb and feel all the nuances.', '2006-10-25 20:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963072, 417028, 58160, '<td valign="top">A decent try on a tough challenge.  While clearly meeting the challenge and competently executed, there''s not much in this shot to capture my attention.  I understand that the lighting was out of your control, but the foreground comes off a bit muddy, which lessens the impact for me.</td>', 'A decent try on a tough challenge.  While clearly meeting the challenge and competently executed, there''s not much in this shot to capture my attention.  I understand that the lighting was out of your control, but the foreground comes off a bit muddy, which lessens the impact for me.', '2006-10-25 20:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963074, 416911, 53964, '<td valign="top">Effective use of DOF and of colour to lead the eye through the shot.</td>', 'Effective use of DOF and of colour to lead the eye through the shot.', '2006-10-25 20:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963075, 416931, 31829, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 5<br/>Lighting/Processing: 5<br/>Composition: 4<br/>Overall Impression: 4<br/>"WOW" factor: 2<br/> <br/>Average Score: 4.0</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 5Lighting/Processing: 5Composition: 4Overall Impression: 4"WOW" factor: 2 Average Score: 4.0', '2006-10-25 20:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963077, 416214, 64928, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  I think some break in the pattern would have made this a more interesting photo...a leftover jacket, cap, water bottle?</td>', 'Nice lighting.  I think some break in the pattern would have made this a more interesting photo...a leftover jacket, cap, water bottle?', '2006-10-25 20:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963079, 416129, 31829, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 10<br/>Lighting/Processing: 5<br/>Composition: 7<br/>Overall Impression: 5<br/>"WOW" factor: 2<br/> <br/>Average Score: 5.8</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 10Lighting/Processing: 5Composition: 7Overall Impression: 5"WOW" factor: 2 Average Score: 5.8', '2006-10-25 20:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963084, 416783, 31829, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 5<br/>Lighting/Processing: 5<br/>Composition: 6<br/>Overall Impression: 4<br/>"WOW" factor: 2<br/> <br/>Average Score: 4.4</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 5Lighting/Processing: 5Composition: 6Overall Impression: 4"WOW" factor: 2 Average Score: 4.4', '2006-10-25 20:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963085, 417008, 31403, '<td valign="top">thank you!!!  Thank you for not simply taking a photo of another empty stadium!<br/> <br/>People have been here - I can tell - this actually IS after the game!  Whew!<br/> <br/>8 for now</td>', 'thank you!!!  Thank you for not simply taking a photo of another empty stadium! People have been here - I can tell - this actually IS after the game!  Whew! 8 for now', '2006-10-25 20:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963089, 415543, 31829, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 10<br/>Lighting/Processing: 3 (very noisy)<br/>Composition: 4<br/>Overall Impression: 4<br/>"WOW" factor: 1<br/> <br/>Average Score: 4.4</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 10Lighting/Processing: 3 (very noisy)Composition: 4Overall Impression: 4"WOW" factor: 1 Average Score: 4.4', '2006-10-25 20:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963093, 415182, 58160, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, even though having the players in it means it doesn''t meet the challenge.  There is a real sense of place/time in this for me, and the candidness of the subjects fits nicely.  The people in the background don''t quite fit in the composition for me.  I would have been tempted to move the camera to the left to see if I could clean up the background.  In PP, I think I would have gone for a bit more contrast (cloudy sky that day?)</td>', 'Not a bad shot, even though having the players in it means it doesn''t meet the challenge.  There is a real sense of place/time in this for me, and the candidness of the subjects fits nicely.  The people in the background don''t quite fit in the composition for me.  I would have been tempted to move the camera to the left to see if I could clean up the background.  In PP, I think I would have gone for a bit more contrast (cloudy sky that day?)', '2006-10-25 20:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963098, 415068, 31829, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 5<br/>Lighting/Processing: 4<br/>Composition: 4<br/>Overall Impression: 3<br/>"WOW" factor: 1<br/> <br/>Average Score: 3.4</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 5Lighting/Processing: 4Composition: 4Overall Impression: 3"WOW" factor: 1 Average Score: 3.4', '2006-10-25 20:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963105, 416239, 64928, '<td valign="top">I like this,  It captures the lonliness of the empty ball field.  The leftover equipment makes you feel it''s AFTER the game as the challenge stated, (even though I realize it could be staged)rather than just giving you the feel of an empty park any time.</td>', 'I like this,  It captures the lonliness of the empty ball field.  The leftover equipment makes you feel it''s AFTER the game as the challenge stated, (even though I realize it could be staged)rather than just giving you the feel of an empty park any time.', '2006-10-25 20:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963108, 416297, 64928, '<td valign="top">looks like the game is still going on</td>', 'looks like the game is still going on', '2006-10-25 20:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
