(2963128, 416841, 31403, '<td valign="top">while technically you met the challenge - this is a photography contest.  Taking a quick snapshot of your messy room makes it hard for me to give you a very good score.  1</td>', 'while technically you met the challenge - this is a photography contest.  Taking a quick snapshot of your messy room makes it hard for me to give you a very good score.  1', '2006-10-25 20:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963130, 414589, 53964, '<td valign="top">I have a thing for repeating patterns, personally :) The reflections off the top of the distant chairs reminds me of waves. This does have major lighting problems, and if you''d like to post it in a thread after the challenge I''m sure those with more skill than I could give you some very helpful advice. :)</td>', 'I have a thing for repeating patterns, personally :) The reflections off the top of the distant chairs reminds me of waves. This does have major lighting problems, and if you''d like to post it in a thread after the challenge I''m sure those with more skill than I could give you some very helpful advice. :)', '2006-10-25 20:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963133, 417000, 31403, '<td valign="top">oh, good take on the challenge!  stopped me cold, made me think, and then smile!  Nice work here for the creative!</td>', 'oh, good take on the challenge!  stopped me cold, made me think, and then smile!  Nice work here for the creative!', '2006-10-25 20:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963134, 415989, 31829, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1 (this is the after the game challenge not after trick-or-treating) ;-)<br/>Lighting/Processing: 4<br/>Composition: 6<br/>Overall Impression: 4<br/>"WOW" factor: 2<br/> <br/>Average Score: 3.4</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1 (this is the after the game challenge not after trick-or-treating) ;-)Lighting/Processing: 4Composition: 6Overall Impression: 4"WOW" factor: 2 Average Score: 3.4', '2006-10-25 20:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963135, 415491, 53964, '<td valign="top">Very striking contrasts and effective use of shallow DOF.</td>', 'Very striking contrasts and effective use of shallow DOF.', '2006-10-25 20:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963139, 415144, 58160, '<td valign="top">Technically, this is an OK shot (lighting/contrast/focus good), but it still leaves me a bit flat, if you''ll pardon the pun :-)  Having all the instruments makes the scene a bit busy, and there''s not anything to really hold my attention, despite the pop of the contrast.  Of course, having played in the band myself, I know that the people haven''t gone home without their instruments, so this barely meets challenge ;-)</td>', 'Technically, this is an OK shot (lighting/contrast/focus good), but it still leaves me a bit flat, if you''ll pardon the pun :-)  Having all the instruments makes the scene a bit busy, and there''s not anything to really hold my attention, despite the pop of the contrast.  Of course, having played in the band myself, I know that the people haven''t gone home without their instruments, so this barely meets challenge ;-)', '2006-10-25 20:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963140, 414424, 31403, '<td valign="top">crop that sky off of there and you''ve got a much stronger photo IMO</td>', 'crop that sky off of there and you''ve got a much stronger photo IMO', '2006-10-25 20:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963141, 415710, 31829, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 3 (maybe "after the game" if the game was yesterday) ;-)<br/>Lighting/Processing: 5<br/>Composition: 6<br/>Overall Impression: 5<br/>"WOW" factor: 2<br/> <br/>Average Score: 4.2</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 3 (maybe "after the game" if the game was yesterday) ;-)Lighting/Processing: 5Composition: 6Overall Impression: 5"WOW" factor: 2 Average Score: 4.2', '2006-10-25 20:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963142, 414680, 53964, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting and the rich hues. This is a subtle shot that doesn''t hit with a "WOW" in the typical 2-second-view-per-vote but has much to offer those who take longer and SEE.</td>', 'Love the lighting and the rich hues. This is a subtle shot that doesn''t hit with a "WOW" in the typical 2-second-view-per-vote but has much to offer those who take longer and SEE.', '2006-10-25 20:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963145, 416000, 58160, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this picture is, and see nothing in it that suggests a game or sports.  As an abstract, I like the composition, although I think a bit more contrast would help the picture "pop" more.</td>', 'I have no idea what this picture is, and see nothing in it that suggests a game or sports.  As an abstract, I like the composition, although I think a bit more contrast would help the picture "pop" more.', '2006-10-25 20:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963146, 415447, 31829, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 3<br/>Lighting/Processing: 2 (soft, flat)<br/>Composition: 3<br/>Overall Impression: 3<br/>"WOW" factor: 1<br/> <br/>Average Score: 2.4</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 3Lighting/Processing: 2 (soft, flat)Composition: 3Overall Impression: 3"WOW" factor: 1 Average Score: 2.4', '2006-10-25 20:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963147, 416931, 64928, '<td valign="top">The blue on the water bottle makes a nice bright spot of color that draws the eye to it.  That and the dirt on the floor give you the feel of the game that has taken place here.  I hope it does well.</td>', 'The blue on the water bottle makes a nice bright spot of color that draws the eye to it.  That and the dirt on the floor give you the feel of the game that has taken place here.  I hope it does well.', '2006-10-25 20:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963149, 416847, 64928, '<td valign="top">I find the foreground too busy and distracting, but the sky is beautiful</td>', 'I find the foreground too busy and distracting, but the sky is beautiful', '2006-10-25 20:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963153, 416108, 53964, '<td valign="top">Nice rich lighting, great still life, but sadly DNMC for me, as I fail to see any sporting venue, or even the suggestion of one.</td>', 'Nice rich lighting, great still life, but sadly DNMC for me, as I fail to see any sporting venue, or even the suggestion of one.', '2006-10-25 20:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963154, 415144, 31829, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 10<br/>Lighting/Processing: 4 (harsh flash lighting)<br/>Composition: 6<br/>Overall Impression: 4<br/>"WOW" factor: 1<br/> <br/>Average Score: 5.0</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 10Lighting/Processing: 4 (harsh flash lighting)Composition: 6Overall Impression: 4"WOW" factor: 1 Average Score: 5.0', '2006-10-25 20:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963155, 413603, 31403, '<td valign="top">nice photo, I don''t see the game or remnants, or hints of one</td>', 'nice photo, I don''t see the game or remnants, or hints of one', '2006-10-25 20:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963156, 416756, 64928, '<td valign="top">What a timely capture! The ant makes this picture for me!</td>', 'What a timely capture! The ant makes this picture for me!', '2006-10-25 20:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963159, 416846, 58160, '<td valign="top">Aside from DNMC, I''ve only got a couple quibbles on this shot.  Composition is nice, although the angle makes it look as if the bar is growing out of her nose.  There''s not much here to keep my attention, either, although I don''t count that as much since the challenge was so tough.</td>', 'Aside from DNMC, I''ve only got a couple quibbles on this shot.  Composition is nice, although the angle makes it look as if the bar is growing out of her nose.  There''s not much here to keep my attention, either, although I don''t count that as much since the challenge was so tough.', '2006-10-25 20:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963161, 415491, 31829, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 5<br/>Lighting/Processing: 4<br/>Composition: 4<br/>Overall Impression: 4<br/>"WOW" factor: 1<br/> <br/>Average Score: 3.6</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 5Lighting/Processing: 4Composition: 4Overall Impression: 4"WOW" factor: 1 Average Score: 3.6', '2006-10-25 20:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963163, 415993, 31403, '<td valign="top">such a beautiful photo, but no real hint that a game has happened - what to do what to do...<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'such a beautiful photo, but no real hint that a game has happened - what to do what to do... 7', '2006-10-25 20:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963165, 416847, 67152, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting idea - and the sky is amazing.  I would have framed this differently to bring in the gorgeous sky and reduce some of the busy-ness of the foreground.</td>', 'This is an interesting idea - and the sky is amazing.  I would have framed this differently to bring in the gorgeous sky and reduce some of the busy-ness of the foreground.', '2006-10-25 20:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963166, 416783, 53964, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, rich colours, and extra interest added by the fall leaves and clouds.  Personally, I''d have tried a bit tighter crop to remove the branch and pole on the left and a bit of the brightest sky, and maybe just TO the lone tree at right to balance the changes?  JMO, of course :)</td>', 'Wonderful, rich colours, and extra interest added by the fall leaves and clouds.  Personally, I''d have tried a bit tighter crop to remove the branch and pole on the left and a bit of the brightest sky, and maybe just TO the lone tree at right to balance the changes?  JMO, of course :)', '2006-10-25 20:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963167, 416281, 58160, '<td valign="top">Technically well done, although a bit oversaturated for my tastes.  I like the idea and the juxtoposition between the duckies and the big balls, but there''s nothing that really grabs my attention.  Cute, but not very memorable.</td>', 'Technically well done, although a bit oversaturated for my tastes.  I like the idea and the juxtoposition between the duckies and the big balls, but there''s nothing that really grabs my attention.  Cute, but not very memorable.', '2006-10-25 20:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963170, 416983, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like the clean lines and simple composition.  I wonder if a grad ND filter would have done anything for you. 7 for now.</td>', 'I like the clean lines and simple composition.  I wonder if a grad ND filter would have done anything for you. 7 for now.', '2006-10-25 20:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963174, 416228, 31403, '<td valign="top">thank you for a beautiful photo that actually hints that a game happened - love the tones here</td>', 'thank you for a beautiful photo that actually hints that a game happened - love the tones here', '2006-10-25 20:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963176, 416239, 53964, '<td valign="top">Great contrast, composition.</td>', 'Great contrast, composition.', '2006-10-25 20:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963177, 416757, 67152, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice shot - the idea is really good but there is not enough contrast for my liking.  I would have increased the contrast to bring out more of the foreground white stripe and also the clouds.</td>', 'Pretty nice shot - the idea is really good but there is not enough contrast for my liking.  I would have increased the contrast to bring out more of the foreground white stripe and also the clouds.', '2006-10-25 20:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963178, 416952, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Flat lighting.  Lighting, unfortunately, often trumps composition. 5</td>', 'Nice composition.  Flat lighting.  Lighting, unfortunately, often trumps composition. 5', '2006-10-25 20:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963180, 417000, 31829, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 10<br/>Lighting/Processing: 6<br/>Composition: 7<br/>Overall Impression: 6<br/>"WOW" factor: 4<br/> <br/>Average Score: 6.6<br/> <br/>Nice refreshing take on this challenge.  Good Job!</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 10Lighting/Processing: 6Composition: 7Overall Impression: 6"WOW" factor: 4 Average Score: 6.6 Nice refreshing take on this challenge.  Good Job!', '2006-10-25 20:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963181, 416681, 40718, '<td valign="top">composition isn''t too bad.  looks like it was perhaps forced by where you could get to and shoot. 5</td>', 'composition isn''t too bad.  looks like it was perhaps forced by where you could get to and shoot. 5', '2006-10-25 20:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963182, 415103, 58160, '<td valign="top">It is tough to get excited over this.  There is quite a bit of noise, particularly in the sky.  The strong color cast detracts a bit.  There''s also nothing in this besides the title that indicates "game" or "sport".</td>', 'It is tough to get excited over this.  There is quite a bit of noise, particularly in the sky.  The strong color cast detracts a bit.  There''s also nothing in this besides the title that indicates "game" or "sport".', '2006-10-25 20:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963185, 415447, 40718, '<td valign="top">nice idea.  I would have scooted just a bit to the left so the left goalpost didn''t cross the statue.  I''m not sure what''s below the statue, but I may have panned down a bit. 6</td>', 'nice idea.  I would have scooted just a bit to the left so the left goalpost didn''t cross the statue.  I''m not sure what''s below the statue, but I may have panned down a bit. 6', '2006-10-25 20:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963187, 416129, 31403, '<td valign="top">that''s it - use the seating graphically to offset the person!  Love this - thank you for including a hint that a game happened!  8 for now</td>', 'that''s it - use the seating graphically to offset the person!  Love this - thank you for including a hint that a game happened!  8 for now', '2006-10-25 20:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
