(2965031, 415029, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s a unique chessboard.  I have never seen one with pieces like that before.  Cool.  I think you would have gotten better impact with the focal point being placed deeper into the board.  As it is you''re losing sharpness at the subject point (knocked over King).  Window lighting is a bit harsh also.  Obviously not a studio setup.  Not sure what the best fix for the lighting is without some reflector - maybe fillflash set to low power (if camera supports it)?  Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'That''s a unique chessboard.  I have never seen one with pieces like that before.  Cool.  I think you would have gotten better impact with the focal point being placed deeper into the board.  As it is you''re losing sharpness at the subject point (knocked over King).  Window lighting is a bit harsh also.  Obviously not a studio setup.  Not sure what the best fix for the lighting is without some reflector - maybe fillflash set to low power (if camera supports it)?  Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-26 13:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965033, 416753, 18349, '<td valign="top">Great image...nice color, clarity, and fits the challenge well.  :)</td>', 'Great image...nice color, clarity, and fits the challenge well.  :)', '2006-10-26 13:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
