(2965472, 416982, 30049, '<td valign="top">Crisp, well focused image.  The red on that baseball just jumps out.  I like the colors in this (sky, bench, field).  Only negative is it feels quite contrived, but how do you get away from that with this challenge?  Hmmm.  Anyway, overall I like it very much.  Good luck!</td>', 'Crisp, well focused image.  The red on that baseball just jumps out.  I like the colors in this (sky, bench, field).  Only negative is it feels quite contrived, but how do you get away from that with this challenge?  Hmmm.  Anyway, overall I like it very much.  Good luck!', '2006-10-26 16:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
