(2965522, 416125, 327, '<td valign="top">I see the point of the shot, so I get it. I''m not sure how this will fly with the dpc voters. Either way, your lighting is good, focus and composition. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I see the point of the shot, so I get it. I''m not sure how this will fly with the dpc voters. Either way, your lighting is good, focus and composition. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-26 16:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
