(2965533, 415968, 327, '<td valign="top">This is just too cluttered to have much impact to the viewer. TOO much going on, weeds, trees, shadows, post, poles, signs. Sorry. Good luck</td>', 'This is just too cluttered to have much impact to the viewer. TOO much going on, weeds, trees, shadows, post, poles, signs. Sorry. Good luck', '2006-10-26 16:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965537, 414680, 327, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective.</td>', 'I love the perspective.', '2006-10-26 16:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965539, 416000, 327, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what I''m looking at??</td>', 'I have no idea what I''m looking at??', '2006-10-26 16:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965542, 415068, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat stadium.</td>', 'Neat stadium.', '2006-10-26 16:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965546, 415103, 327, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop would of helped here. ?Not sure what this has to do with the challenge theme.</td>', 'I think a tighter crop would of helped here. ?Not sure what this has to do with the challenge theme.', '2006-10-26 16:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965549, 414090, 327, '<td valign="top">My first thought when viewing this shot is my grandsons. They play football (highschool) and it makes me think of the coach yelling "take a knee"!! <br/>You cut his right foot a bit too snug but the focus and desat is very nice. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'My first thought when viewing this shot is my grandsons. They play football (highschool) and it makes me think of the coach yelling "take a knee"!! You cut his right foot a bit too snug but the focus and desat is very nice. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-26 16:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965674, 416748, 58610, '<td valign="top">Like your colors. Too bad about the power lines in the background.</td>', 'Like your colors. Too bad about the power lines in the background.', '2006-10-26 17:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965677, 415704, 58610, '<td valign="top">The ghostlike effect adds to the empty feeling.</td>', 'The ghostlike effect adds to the empty feeling.', '2006-10-26 17:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965694, 415895, 29748, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Clear and concise.  Good point.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Clear and concise.  Good point.', '2006-10-26 17:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965696, 415450, 58610, '<td valign="top">Your dirt color is a little too orange for my taste. Did you take this with a Nikon Coolpix? They tend to exagerate the reds. I would have gone for a wider crop including the guy on the tractor as well.</td>', 'Your dirt color is a little too orange for my taste. Did you take this with a Nikon Coolpix? They tend to exagerate the reds. I would have gone for a wider crop including the guy on the tractor as well.', '2006-10-26 17:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965697, 415710, 29748, '<td valign="top">Crisp and clear. IMHO could have done with out the bushes in the front of picyure.</td>', 'Crisp and clear. IMHO could have done with out the bushes in the front of picyure.', '2006-10-26 17:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965698, 416841, 58610, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet challenge.</td>', 'Doesn''t meet challenge.', '2006-10-26 17:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965711, 416997, 29748, '<td valign="top">Green is kind of blown from lighting?</td>', 'Green is kind of blown from lighting?', '2006-10-26 17:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965712, 415993, 58610, '<td valign="top">That we all get to go home now? Nice closeup.</td>', 'That we all get to go home now? Nice closeup.', '2006-10-26 17:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965721, 416145, 58610, '<td valign="top">This is the shot I wanted to use, but there were still people in our stadium at sunset. Nice colors.</td>', 'This is the shot I wanted to use, but there were still people in our stadium at sunset. Nice colors.', '2006-10-26 17:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965731, 416973, 62895, '<td valign="top">Whats the game?</td>', 'Whats the game?', '2006-10-26 17:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965732, 414488, 58610, '<td valign="top">Good old stadium orange. Probably the same the world round. Tough to make it look spectacular, isn''t it?  Nice try.</td>', 'Good old stadium orange. Probably the same the world round. Tough to make it look spectacular, isn''t it?  Nice try.', '2006-10-26 17:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965738, 415416, 58610, '<td valign="top">NIce perspective. Good job of toning down the highlights. Looks like you sued a polarizing filter to darken the sky?</td>', 'NIce perspective. Good job of toning down the highlights. Looks like you sued a polarizing filter to darken the sky?', '2006-10-26 17:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965740, 416281, 58610, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet challenge.</td>', 'Doesn''t meet challenge.', '2006-10-26 17:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965748, 416289, 58610, '<td valign="top">This would be a great entry it were in focus and had greater depth of field. I really like the contrast between the black sky and the stadium lights. I also like the way the black track sets the field apart. And all the lines moving diagonally really gives this motion and interest. Great job otherwise.</td>', 'This would be a great entry it were in focus and had greater depth of field. I really like the contrast between the black sky and the stadium lights. I also like the way the black track sets the field apart. And all the lines moving diagonally really gives this motion and interest. Great job otherwise.', '2006-10-26 17:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965751, 416954, 58610, '<td valign="top">Your shadows are a little too dark for a black and white photo. Good perspective, but the composition is too center weighted for me.</td>', 'Your shadows are a little too dark for a black and white photo. Good perspective, but the composition is too center weighted for me.', '2006-10-26 18:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965765, 416386, 58610, '<td valign="top">Great juxtaposition of imagaes. The discrepency between where we choose to spend our money and where we should be spending it is very clear. I like your composition, too. Could be a little sharper.</td>', 'Great juxtaposition of imagaes. The discrepency between where we choose to spend our money and where we should be spending it is very clear. I like your composition, too. Could be a little sharper.', '2006-10-26 18:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965768, 416239, 58610, '<td valign="top">Nice story being told here. Your image is strong and well composed.</td>', 'Nice story being told here. Your image is strong and well composed.', '2006-10-26 18:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965778, 416785, 58610, '<td valign="top">You had a great sky to work with. Too bad you didn''t take advantage of it. This is very badly focused and really not well composed. Also, with people in the shot it doesn''t really meet the challenge.</td>', 'You had a great sky to work with. Too bad you didn''t take advantage of it. This is very badly focused and really not well composed. Also, with people in the shot it doesn''t really meet the challenge.', '2006-10-26 18:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965784, 416858, 58610, '<td valign="top">Looks like sports stuff on the front lawn. It''s OK. I got the same comment on my photo, and it was in the stadium.</td>', 'Looks like sports stuff on the front lawn. It''s OK. I got the same comment on my photo, and it was in the stadium.', '2006-10-26 18:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965785, 416757, 58610, '<td valign="top">Too dark overall. Can''t really see the net all that well to see that it''s empty.</td>', 'Too dark overall. Can''t really see the net all that well to see that it''s empty.', '2006-10-26 18:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965791, 416228, 58610, '<td valign="top">Well, this is stretching the challenge a bit (all the people gone) but nonetheless I like the composition and the tone of the photo.</td>', 'Well, this is stretching the challenge a bit (all the people gone) but nonetheless I like the composition and the tone of the photo.', '2006-10-26 18:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965797, 415543, 48245, '<td valign="top">Not sure how that became check mate with the queen and rook on the same line... seems like the king could move up to line 7.</td>', 'Not sure how that became check mate with the queen and rook on the same line... seems like the king could move up to line 7.', '2006-10-26 18:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965802, 416125, 58610, '<td valign="top">Nice try, but I won''t be drawn in with cheap/taudry imagery. There''s no stadium here! (Can I borrow this for a few days?)</td>', 'Nice try, but I won''t be drawn in with cheap/taudry imagery. There''s no stadium here! (Can I borrow this for a few days?)', '2006-10-26 18:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965807, 417028, 37320, '<td valign="top">Your school must be good at sports.</td>', 'Your school must be good at sports.', '2006-10-26 18:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965817, 415814, 58610, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective. Good composition. I wish you hadn''t clipped off the top of the net. Also, if you had shot this from the opposite corner (with the sun behind), the net would have had a much greater presence in the photo.</td>', 'Nice perspective. Good composition. I wish you hadn''t clipped off the top of the net. Also, if you had shot this from the opposite corner (with the sun behind), the net would have had a much greater presence in the photo.', '2006-10-26 18:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965823, 416125, 36988, '<td valign="top">An excellent take on the the challenge and very nicely executed... good job!</td>', 'An excellent take on the the challenge and very nicely executed... good job!', '2006-10-26 18:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965829, 416847, 58610, '<td valign="top">Well, I''m GUESSIN'' this is DENVER? NIce sky and contrast with the front of the building. The horse scene gets a little lost in the busy-ness of the photo.</td>', 'Well, I''m GUESSIN'' this is DENVER? NIce sky and contrast with the front of the building. The horse scene gets a little lost in the busy-ness of the photo.', '2006-10-26 18:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965831, 416297, 58610, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet challenge.</td>', 'Doesn''t meet challenge.', '2006-10-26 18:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965893, 415691, 58610, '<td valign="top">Oops.Whoooooooaaaaaaaaa!(Klunk,klunk.)Ohmigosh! Nice perspective.</td>', 'Oops.Whoooooooaaaaaaaaa!(Klunk,klunk.)Ohmigosh! Nice perspective.', '2006-10-26 19:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965924, 415068, 58610, '<td valign="top">Could you have darkened the sky? I think that would add the drama that''s missing here. Nice composition, great building. Lacks interest, somehow.</td>', 'Could you have darkened the sky? I think that would add the drama that''s missing here. Nice composition, great building. Lacks interest, somehow.', '2006-10-26 19:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965925, 416929, 58610, '<td valign="top">I think the shot is a little mundane this way. If you''d cropped it down to just the front base I think you''d have a much more interesting photograph. IMO. Maybe you''d have to change the title to "Nobody on Base".</td>', 'I think the shot is a little mundane this way. If you''d cropped it down to just the front base I think you''d have a much more interesting photograph. IMO. Maybe you''d have to change the title to "Nobody on Base".', '2006-10-26 19:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965981, 415968, 58610, '<td valign="top">Disc golf, right? My son''s into that. Nature''s arena. I guess that''s fair. Picture''s not well focused, though. And, you could have given more thought to your composition.</td>', 'Disc golf, right? My son''s into that. Nature''s arena. I guess that''s fair. Picture''s not well focused, though. And, you could have given more thought to your composition.', '2006-10-26 19:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966164, 415029, 63503, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, perhaps a bit too much light by the far angle of the board, very nice in generall though, you even constraucted a true check mate, I would rate this picture a 7 or 8, but I do not think of cess as a sport, tehrefore I do not think it meets the challenge.</td>', 'Nice composition, perhaps a bit too much light by the far angle of the board, very nice in generall though, you even constraucted a true check mate, I would rate this picture a 7 or 8, but I do not think of cess as a sport, tehrefore I do not think it meets the challenge.', '2006-10-26 20:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966174, 413418, 62024, '<td valign="top">Very good photo, but how does it relate to the subject, in some other competition I''d rate this photo high but I just can''t see how it belongs in this particular competition, sorry.</td>', 'Very good photo, but how does it relate to the subject, in some other competition I''d rate this photo high but I just can''t see how it belongs in this particular competition, sorry.', '2006-10-26 20:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966249, 413603, 24073, '<td valign="top">Really dark on my end, I have checked on 2 different monitors, and it still is very hard  to see what I am looking at.</td>', 'Really dark on my end, I have checked on 2 different monitors, and it still is very hard  to see what I am looking at.', '2006-10-26 21:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966327, 416982, 47541, '<td valign="top">Good use of lighting to hide what could be distracting detail in the background: 7</td>', 'Good use of lighting to hide what could be distracting detail in the background: 7', '2006-10-26 21:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966330, 416915, 47541, '<td valign="top">Good concept.  Lighting seems a little harsh but I suspect that''s just what lighting was at the gate?  Perhaps more of a close-u on the lock? 6</td>', 'Good concept.  Lighting seems a little harsh but I suspect that''s just what lighting was at the gate?  Perhaps more of a close-u on the lock? 6', '2006-10-26 21:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966332, 416931, 47541, '<td valign="top">Oh dear, someone left a full water bottle behind!  The bright lighting works ok in this.  I''m a little unsure about the grainy feel though: 6</td>', 'Oh dear, someone left a full water bottle behind!  The bright lighting works ok in this.  I''m a little unsure about the grainy feel though: 6', '2006-10-26 21:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966337, 417000, 47541, '<td valign="top">Is sudoko a sport?  I''ll assume so.  Is the game over?  Doesn''t look like it.  Aside from that waffle good image.  The lighting on the pencil is great: 6</td>', 'Is sudoko a sport?  I''ll assume so.  Is the game over?  Doesn''t look like it.  Aside from that waffle good image.  The lighting on the pencil is great: 6', '2006-10-26 21:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966341, 416846, 47541, '<td valign="top">The image is nice.  The B&amp;W reduces distractions from what looks like a bright sun.  The fence at the right is on a good angle to take the eye up the image but...there is still a spectator at the venue!  Usually a 6 but DNMC=3</td>', 'The image is nice.  The B&W reduces distractions from what looks like a bright sun.  The fence at the right is on a good angle to take the eye up the image but...there is still a spectator at the venue!  Usually a 6 but DNMC=3', '2006-10-26 21:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966342, 416952, 47541, '<td valign="top">A good shot of a common theme.  This is nice in that the hat is the subject but the OOF background is composed in a way that is interesting without taking away from the hat: 8</td>', 'A good shot of a common theme.  This is nice in that the hat is the subject but the OOF background is composed in a way that is interesting without taking away from the hat: 8', '2006-10-26 21:44:36.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2966343, 415144, 47541, '<td valign="top">A good idea.  Lighting seems very harsh.  7</td>', 'A good idea.  Lighting seems very harsh.  7', '2006-10-26 21:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966345, 415710, 47541, '<td valign="top">An ok image but nothing "grabs" me in it.  I''d like the posts to be centered and not obscured by the seats.  Nice colours. 6</td>', 'An ok image but nothing "grabs" me in it.  I''d like the posts to be centered and not obscured by the seats.  Nice colours. 6', '2006-10-26 21:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966346, 417011, 47541, '<td valign="top">Good choice in B&amp;W given the harsh lighting in the arena.  A tighter crop to remove the walls at the sides perhaps? 7</td>', 'Good choice in B&W given the harsh lighting in the arena.  A tighter crop to remove the walls at the sides perhaps? 7', '2006-10-26 21:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966347, 417021, 47541, '<td valign="top">Great colours in the sky!  Shame about that lighting pole huh! 7</td>', 'Great colours in the sky!  Shame about that lighting pole huh! 7', '2006-10-26 21:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966349, 414488, 47541, '<td valign="top">I love the idea!  The orange seats form a great pattern but the glimpse of the areana seems distracting - I guess you have it to hilight that this is a sporting venue? 8</td>', 'I love the idea!  The orange seats form a great pattern but the glimpse of the areana seems distracting - I guess you have it to hilight that this is a sporting venue? 8', '2006-10-26 21:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966351, 417028, 47541, '<td valign="top">An ok shot but lacks any "wow" 6</td>', 'An ok shot but lacks any "wow" 6', '2006-10-26 21:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966353, 414589, 47541, '<td valign="top">The idea is good but overall a bit too dark and grainy for my tastes: 5</td>', 'The idea is good but overall a bit too dark and grainy for my tastes: 5', '2006-10-26 21:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966356, 416228, 47541, '<td valign="top">There is lots to like in this image: the colours, the lighting (the persons shadow is great how it is like another person).  Usually an 8 but not all the people seem to have gone home so DNMC=3 (+1 more ''cause I do like it!)</td>', 'There is lots to like in this image: the colours, the lighting (the persons shadow is great how it is like another person).  Usually an 8 but not all the people seem to have gone home so DNMC=3 (+1 more ''cause I do like it!)', '2006-10-26 21:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966358, 417008, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The grainy feel works in this.  The lines in the image all lead to the same place: 8</td>', 'Nice shot.  The grainy feel works in this.  The lines in the image all lead to the same place: 8', '2006-10-26 21:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966365, 416198, 64446, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a sporting venue in it as well.</td>', 'I''d like to see a sporting venue in it as well.', '2006-10-26 21:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966428, 416982, 58160, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  Compositionally, you''ve really paid attention, even lining up the right-hand light pole with the links in the fence.  Only quibble I''ve got is the red on the baseball seems over-saturated, but that''s pretty minor.</td>', 'Good shot.  Compositionally, you''ve really paid attention, even lining up the right-hand light pole with the links in the fence.  Only quibble I''ve got is the red on the baseball seems over-saturated, but that''s pretty minor.', '2006-10-26 22:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966429, 416847, 58160, '<td valign="top">Technically well executed, but nothing really grabs my attention.</td>', 'Technically well executed, but nothing really grabs my attention.', '2006-10-26 22:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966434, 413603, 58160, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what the subject is, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt and guess it is a golf course.  Not a bad shot, but the sky dominates so much it detracts from the subject.  Compared to the sky, though, the foreground feels muddy, which further reduces the impact of what (I think) the subject is.</td>', 'I can''t tell what the subject is, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt and guess it is a golf course.  Not a bad shot, but the sky dominates so much it detracts from the subject.  Compared to the sky, though, the foreground feels muddy, which further reduces the impact of what (I think) the subject is.', '2006-10-26 22:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966443, 415068, 58160, '<td valign="top">Within the possibilities of the lighting, this was technically well executed.  Tough to work with such flat lighting, though.  I''m sure it would have turned out better with a bit more sunlight to make the colors pop and give some more contrast.  Unfortunately, nothing in this shot jumps out at me and grabs my attention.  When I look at it, my mind goes "Eh, another stadium".</td>', 'Within the possibilities of the lighting, this was technically well executed.  Tough to work with such flat lighting, though.  I''m sure it would have turned out better with a bit more sunlight to make the colors pop and give some more contrast.  Unfortunately, nothing in this shot jumps out at me and grabs my attention.  When I look at it, my mind goes "Eh, another stadium".', '2006-10-26 22:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966448, 416983, 58160, '<td valign="top">Good concept, pretty well executed.  If it had been me, I would probably have cropped in a bit, maybe doing portrait mode to get the rightmost two lights, bleachers, and some of the grass.  As it is, the brightness of the lights keep my eyes so high, I almost miss the beautifully lit fog.</td>', 'Good concept, pretty well executed.  If it had been me, I would probably have cropped in a bit, maybe doing portrait mode to get the rightmost two lights, bleachers, and some of the grass.  As it is, the brightness of the lights keep my eyes so high, I almost miss the beautifully lit fog.', '2006-10-26 22:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966457, 416297, 58160, '<td valign="top">I struggled scoring this one.  I get what you''re trying to do, pushing the limits of the challenge and all, but between fighting with the challenge description (no sports, no venue, and people in the image), and my visceral reaction to the model''s annoying expression, I just can''t bring myself to like this shot.</td>', 'I struggled scoring this one.  I get what you''re trying to do, pushing the limits of the challenge and all, but between fighting with the challenge description (no sports, no venue, and people in the image), and my visceral reaction to the model''s annoying expression, I just can''t bring myself to like this shot.', '2006-10-26 22:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966466, 415558, 58160, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but the execution didn''t quite make it.  Given the prominance of the lock and gate, I feel it should have been in crisp focus.  Must have been an overcast day, too, for the image to have such flat contrast.</td>', 'Nice concept, but the execution didn''t quite make it.  Given the prominance of the lock and gate, I feel it should have been in crisp focus.  Must have been an overcast day, too, for the image to have such flat contrast.', '2006-10-26 22:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966471, 413418, 17203, '<td valign="top">Um... ya lost me here. Nice portrait, but a sporting venue after all the people went home?</td>', 'Um... ya lost me here. Nice portrait, but a sporting venue after all the people went home?', '2006-10-26 22:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966479, 416915, 58160, '<td valign="top">For such a stark image, the subject is very subtle.  I had to look a couple times before I realized what my perspective was.  I find myself trying hard to like this, but my eye keeps wandering off the right side of the picture into that big expanse of darkness.  Technically quite well done, though.</td>', 'For such a stark image, the subject is very subtle.  I had to look a couple times before I realized what my perspective was.  I find myself trying hard to like this, but my eye keeps wandering off the right side of the picture into that big expanse of darkness.  Technically quite well done, though.', '2006-10-26 22:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966491, 415543, 58160, '<td valign="top">Nice try on challenge interpretation, but the execution didn''t make it work.  The contrast is way too flat, particularly for an indoor shot like this, and it looks to have a yellow-greenish cast to it.  I know this is nit-picky, but having played chess, I can''t think of a way the pieces could have gotten into this layout, and in the way I''m used to playing, the captured pieces would be on opposite sides (white player keeps black pieces, and vice-versa).  With a couple things fixed, though, this would have been a nice shot.</td>', 'Nice try on challenge interpretation, but the execution didn''t make it work.  The contrast is way too flat, particularly for an indoor shot like this, and it looks to have a yellow-greenish cast to it.  I know this is nit-picky, but having played chess, I can''t think of a way the pieces could have gotten into this layout, and in the way I''m used to playing, the captured pieces would be on opposite sides (white player keeps black pieces, and vice-versa).  With a couple things fixed, though, this would have been a nice shot.', '2006-10-26 22:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966492, 416125, 64571, '<td valign="top">Loved this - love the idea - great!</td>', 'Loved this - love the idea - great!', '2006-10-26 22:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966495, 414589, 58160, '<td valign="top">Oooh, so close!  This would have been a fantastic shot with a bit more contrast and maybe brightened up a bit.  From the looks, the lighting must have been pretty low, but I can''t help but think some post-proc would have made everything snap a bit more.</td>', 'Oooh, so close!  This would have been a fantastic shot with a bit more contrast and maybe brightened up a bit.  From the looks, the lighting must have been pretty low, but I can''t help but think some post-proc would have made everything snap a bit more.', '2006-10-26 22:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966499, 416929, 17203, '<td valign="top">Nicely balanced and <i>great</i> title. For me, it would have been nice to show  feet leaving in the distance, or a piece of litter to demonstrate that a game took place, but still one of the better entries this week. Gook luck!</td>', 'Nicely balanced and great title. For me, it would have been nice to show  feet leaving in the distance, or a piece of litter to demonstrate that a game took place, but still one of the better entries this week. Gook luck!', '2006-10-26 22:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966501, 417004, 58160, '<td valign="top">Crisp focus, good lighting, the contrasting colors really pop.  I would have cropped it differently, though, maybe doing square with one of the yellow stripes running diagonally through it to enhance the abstractness of it.  Well done.</td>', 'Crisp focus, good lighting, the contrasting colors really pop.  I would have cropped it differently, though, maybe doing square with one of the yellow stripes running diagonally through it to enhance the abstractness of it.  Well done.', '2006-10-26 22:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966504, 416505, 64571, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors - great capture - very nice</td>', 'beautiful colors - great capture - very nice', '2006-10-26 22:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966507, 416954, 58160, '<td valign="top">I like nearly everything in this shot.  Only minor thing is the tops of the goal posts get lost in the clouds a bit, but that''s pretty minor.  I love the positions and lighting on the shoes.  Good job!</td>', 'I like nearly everything in this shot.  Only minor thing is the tops of the goal posts get lost in the clouds a bit, but that''s pretty minor.  I love the positions and lighting on the shoes.  Good job!', '2006-10-26 23:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966508, 416847, 64571, '<td valign="top">great shot - love the angle</td>', 'great shot - love the angle', '2006-10-26 23:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966510, 414090, 17203, '<td valign="top">A good moment to capture, but doesn''t this normally occur <i>before</i> the game? Cropping the dark grass off the bottom seems to make a better composition I think, but the dash of color is nice.</td>', 'A good moment to capture, but doesn''t this normally occur before the game? Cropping the dark grass off the bottom seems to make a better composition I think, but the dash of color is nice.', '2006-10-26 23:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966517, 415691, 58160, '<td valign="top">That top section of railing is distracting to me.  I don''t know if I would have  moved farther forward to get rid of the chunk in the lower right or moved back to include the whole piece, but the way it is doesn''t seem right.  Beyond that, though, nice image.  The contrast and lighting work nicely, and the slightly off-center arrangement helps keep it from being too static.</td>', 'That top section of railing is distracting to me.  I don''t know if I would have  moved farther forward to get rid of the chunk in the lower right or moved back to include the whole piece, but the way it is doesn''t seem right.  Beyond that, though, nice image.  The contrast and lighting work nicely, and the slightly off-center arrangement helps keep it from being too static.', '2006-10-26 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966519, 416402, 17203, '<td valign="top">A little too "clean" for after a game maybe. Nice color and location. I like having the bucket to break up the scene, but wish it wasn''t so centered.</td>', 'A little too "clean" for after a game maybe. Nice color and location. I like having the bucket to break up the scene, but wish it wasn''t so centered.', '2006-10-26 23:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966533, 416915, 17203, '<td valign="top">Yes, it meets the challenge, but not much image appeal IMO. Depending on the background, maybe you could have a shot the fence silhouetted against the sky as the sun was rising or setting?</td>', 'Yes, it meets the challenge, but not much image appeal IMO. Depending on the background, maybe you could have a shot the fence silhouetted against the sky as the sun was rising or setting?', '2006-10-26 23:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
