(2968490, 417008, 47640, '<td valign="top">This made me stop and think...some were sad, some happy...who? we''ll never know. Very reflective photo which tells a lot.</td>', 'This made me stop and think...some were sad, some happy...who? we''ll never know. Very reflective photo which tells a lot.', '2006-10-27 15:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968510, 414589, 63588, '<td valign="top">I like seat pictures and yours is well done. It''s dark for me (but I know that can be my monitor). I like the composition which gives it movement and the lighting complements that movement.</td>', 'I like seat pictures and yours is well done. It''s dark for me (but I know that can be my monitor). I like the composition which gives it movement and the lighting complements that movement.', '2006-10-27 16:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968522, 416783, 63588, '<td valign="top">I always thought the "19th hole" was the clubhouse (but I''m not a golfer so maybe not). I like your choice of venue. I like how the darker grass leads the eye to the green but think a tighter crop on the bottom would make the picture more compelling (and cut out some of the empty sky too) making a much more horizontal image. I''d like to see it with it cropped on the left just left of the tree line (so that the slope up to the green really grabs your eye and the tree line also would help to move your eye left to right with the open space on the right). You have some nice clouds on that right side to give the open space more impact.</td>', 'I always thought the "19th hole" was the clubhouse (but I''m not a golfer so maybe not). I like your choice of venue. I like how the darker grass leads the eye to the green but think a tighter crop on the bottom would make the picture more compelling (and cut out some of the empty sky too) making a much more horizontal image. I''d like to see it with it cropped on the left just left of the tree line (so that the slope up to the green really grabs your eye and the tree line also would help to move your eye left to right with the open space on the right). You have some nice clouds on that right side to give the open space more impact.', '2006-10-27 16:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968530, 415968, 63588, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of an atypical sporting venue. The path/road gives a good direction for the eye to follow. I might like this better compositionally if the perspective were lower to the ground with the start sign prominent - might bring the focus to feet. Does that make sense? Just my 2 cents. Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'Nice choice of an atypical sporting venue. The path/road gives a good direction for the eye to follow. I might like this better compositionally if the perspective were lower to the ground with the start sign prominent - might bring the focus to feet. Does that make sense? Just my 2 cents. Thanks for sharing.', '2006-10-27 16:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968531, 413418, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is a great image; very emotive and expressive, and I love the contrast and the b/w conversion.  Unfortunately, I''m not sure how it meets the challenge description.</td>', 'This is a great image; very emotive and expressive, and I love the contrast and the b/w conversion.  Unfortunately, I''m not sure how it meets the challenge description.', '2006-10-27 16:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968534, 416757, 63588, '<td valign="top">I like the moodiness here and it certainly feels like it should be after game. My eye is bothered by having the goal post facing off the image - I''d like it better if the crop moved the back of the goal/netting to the right and left some open space on the left.</td>', 'I like the moodiness here and it certainly feels like it should be after game. My eye is bothered by having the goal post facing off the image - I''d like it better if the crop moved the back of the goal/netting to the right and left some open space on the left.', '2006-10-27 16:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968538, 416124, 63588, '<td valign="top">This image has impact. I think this wa a pretty tough challenge but I was looking forward to seeing the results - your image delivers. The fence line is well composed - the negative space balances the picture and gives the "post game" feel. I might like it a little more if you cropped off a bit of the bottom. Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'This image has impact. I think this wa a pretty tough challenge but I was looking forward to seeing the results - your image delivers. The fence line is well composed - the negative space balances the picture and gives the "post game" feel. I might like it a little more if you cropped off a bit of the bottom. Thanks for sharing.', '2006-10-27 16:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
