(2968549, 416386, 63588, '<td valign="top">This image really works for me. I like how you framed the "big city" in the fencing and the deteriations of the fencing makes this image have a story. The b&amp;w conversion really works here too. I''m finding more here than when I first viewed. Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'This image really works for me. I like how you framed the "big city" in the fencing and the deteriations of the fencing makes this image have a story. The b&w conversion really works here too. I''m finding more here than when I first viewed. Thanks for sharing.', '2006-10-27 16:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
