(2968604, 415543, 18349, '<td valign="top">Image seems noisy and lacking in contrast.  Concept is good, but I think execution could be a bit better.  Composition seems busy and crowded; maybe a lower angle or different slant of the board might help.  Chess boards and pieces are difficult to shoot and make them look dynamic.  I appreciate the effort.</td>', 'Image seems noisy and lacking in contrast.  Concept is good, but I think execution could be a bit better.  Composition seems busy and crowded; maybe a lower angle or different slant of the board might help.  Chess boards and pieces are difficult to shoot and make them look dynamic.  I appreciate the effort.', '2006-10-27 16:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968605, 415029, 18349, '<td valign="top">Image has some hotspots that distract the eyes.  Concept is good, but I think execution could be a bit better.  Composition seems disjointed and lighting is spotty; maybe a different angle of the board might help, or use more available light or a diffused flash.  Chess boards and pieces are difficult to shoot and make them look dynamic.  I appreciate the effort.</td>', 'Image has some hotspots that distract the eyes.  Concept is good, but I think execution could be a bit better.  Composition seems disjointed and lighting is spotty; maybe a different angle of the board might help, or use more available light or a diffused flash.  Chess boards and pieces are difficult to shoot and make them look dynamic.  I appreciate the effort.', '2006-10-27 16:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968612, 416841, 18349, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of my sons'' rooms.  I''ve seen this same thing before...deja vu all over again.  ;)<br/> <br/>Composition of the image is very cluttered (no pun intended); there is really nowhere for the eye to rest (a main focal point).  Giving voters too much to look at in the few seconds voters give images is a sure way to get mediocre scores.  I think that if this had been taken at an angle other than from standing position (eye level) it might have more of a dynamic appeal.</td>', 'Reminds me of my sons'' rooms.  I''ve seen this same thing before...deja vu all over again.  ;) Composition of the image is very cluttered (no pun intended); there is really nowhere for the eye to rest (a main focal point).  Giving voters too much to look at in the few seconds voters give images is a sure way to get mediocre scores.  I think that if this had been taken at an angle other than from standing position (eye level) it might have more of a dynamic appeal.', '2006-10-27 16:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968613, 415182, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, great clarity, color, concept...but the DNMC votes will probably keep this image out of the running.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful image, great clarity, color, concept...but the DNMC votes will probably keep this image out of the running.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-27 16:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968614, 414743, 18349, '<td valign="top">Interesting array of lines and colors.  The background reflection is a distraction for me; as is the text on the left side.  Perhaps if this were advanced editing there would be ways to obscure some of the distractions and add emphasis to the abstract nature of the image.</td>', 'Interesting array of lines and colors.  The background reflection is a distraction for me; as is the text on the left side.  Perhaps if this were advanced editing there would be ways to obscure some of the distractions and add emphasis to the abstract nature of the image.', '2006-10-27 16:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968616, 416973, 18349, '<td valign="top">Great PJ piece...love the immediacy as well as the tonal range.  Hope you aren''t slammed for DNMC.  One of my favorites of the bunch.</td>', 'Great PJ piece...love the immediacy as well as the tonal range.  Hope you aren''t slammed for DNMC.  One of my favorites of the bunch.', '2006-10-27 16:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968620, 415968, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is kind of a confusing image, and were it not for the title, I''d be lost.  I am guilty of not giving images ample viewing time before voting, so speaking from experience, it''s difficult to vote on confusing ones in just a couple of seconds.  The image itself seems to need some contrast and maybe a bit more saturation (it could be my crappy monitor), which might give it more "oomph."</td>', 'This is kind of a confusing image, and were it not for the title, I''d be lost.  I am guilty of not giving images ample viewing time before voting, so speaking from experience, it''s difficult to vote on confusing ones in just a couple of seconds.  The image itself seems to need some contrast and maybe a bit more saturation (it could be my crappy monitor), which might give it more "oomph."', '2006-10-27 16:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968632, 416846, 18349, '<td valign="top">You''re probably suffering from some DNMC votes for the person in the shot.  I like the angle and the concept; the model seems to be almost smiling, which is confusing given the title.  I think some contrast boost would give the image a bit more drama as well.</td>', 'You''re probably suffering from some DNMC votes for the person in the shot.  I like the angle and the concept; the model seems to be almost smiling, which is confusing given the title.  I think some contrast boost would give the image a bit more drama as well.', '2006-10-27 16:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968637, 415103, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very noisy image...colors are a bit off on my monitor.  The bottom of the shot is pretty confusing and jumbled.  I might have cropped everything out of the bottom and left just the flag and flagpole.</td>', 'Very noisy image...colors are a bit off on my monitor.  The bottom of the shot is pretty confusing and jumbled.  I might have cropped everything out of the bottom and left just the flag and flagpole.', '2006-10-27 16:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968641, 414090, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice use of selective desat; interesting and appealing image.  I''m sure you''re getting hit with the DNMC votes.  I would suggest not cropping out the foot if at all possible; it makes the image feel "amputated" if you pardon the pun.</td>', 'Nice use of selective desat; interesting and appealing image.  I''m sure you''re getting hit with the DNMC votes.  I would suggest not cropping out the foot if at all possible; it makes the image feel "amputated" if you pardon the pun.', '2006-10-27 16:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968645, 416228, 18349, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot...I wonder if you''re being slammed with DNMC votes.  I love the lighting and the great emotive quality of the shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot...I wonder if you''re being slammed with DNMC votes.  I love the lighting and the great emotive quality of the shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-27 17:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968693, 415447, 41554, '<td valign="top">This would work better if they were perfectly centered. It seems a bit unbalanced as is.</td>', 'This would work better if they were perfectly centered. It seems a bit unbalanced as is.', '2006-10-27 17:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968891, 416753, 34915, '<td valign="top">too green</td>', 'too green', '2006-10-27 18:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968922, 415895, 18349, '<td valign="top">This might be in violation of the literal representation of artwork rule.  Interesting concept; sharp image.</td>', 'This might be in violation of the literal representation of artwork rule.  Interesting concept; sharp image.', '2006-10-27 19:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968929, 417013, 18349, '<td valign="top">Good perspective and angle; I like the lighting and the expanse of the shot.  The colors need a bit more pop and the entire image could stand some contrast adjustment.  The lens flare is a bit more of a distraction than an addition to the drama of the shot.  IMHO It looks more like spots on the lens due to moisture or humidity than anything.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good perspective and angle; I like the lighting and the expanse of the shot.  The colors need a bit more pop and the entire image could stand some contrast adjustment.  The lens flare is a bit more of a distraction than an addition to the drama of the shot.  IMHO It looks more like spots on the lens due to moisture or humidity than anything.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-27 19:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968933, 416952, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is a good concept but the image feels very cramped.  I''d prefer to see more of the outside area around the cap...as it is, it feels very cut-off and crowded.</td>', 'This is a good concept but the image feels very cramped.  I''d prefer to see more of the outside area around the cap...as it is, it feels very cut-off and crowded.', '2006-10-27 19:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968943, 415144, 18349, '<td valign="top">This image lacks a clear focal point.   There is too much for the eye to settle on and seems cluttered.  The angle in which it is taken from is also a bit distracting; without the ability to use perspective tools it makes it seem slanted.  I''d have taken some steps to the right to center up and not have such leaning lines.</td>', 'This image lacks a clear focal point.   There is too much for the eye to settle on and seems cluttered.  The angle in which it is taken from is also a bit distracting; without the ability to use perspective tools it makes it seem slanted.  I''d have taken some steps to the right to center up and not have such leaning lines.', '2006-10-27 19:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968947, 416108, 18349, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot for any other challenge; quite soft and lacking in contrast and IMHO is very loosely shoehorned into the challenge via title.</td>', 'Pretty shot for any other challenge; quite soft and lacking in contrast and IMHO is very loosely shoehorned into the challenge via title.', '2006-10-27 19:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968949, 416739, 18349, '<td valign="top">I like this idea a lot but the image is suffering from lack of sharpness, contrast, and saturation.</td>', 'I like this idea a lot but the image is suffering from lack of sharpness, contrast, and saturation.', '2006-10-27 19:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968954, 416748, 18349, '<td valign="top">Just seeing the fence without the field is really not giving much of a shot of the venue or the environment.  There could be a game going on for all we know in the way that it is shot and/or cropped.  Interesting color and good sharpness, however.</td>', 'Just seeing the fence without the field is really not giving much of a shot of the venue or the environment.  There could be a game going on for all we know in the way that it is shot and/or cropped.  Interesting color and good sharpness, however.', '2006-10-27 19:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968970, 414589, 18349, '<td valign="top">I have to keep looking at this one...it is growing on me more and more each time I open it up.  I have to admit that on my first pass-through, I gave it a 3.  Now I''ve seen it about a dozen times, and have moved the score up to a 5 because I really like the angle and the light.  I think it does need more contrast and perhaps some curves adjustment, and that might lead to the need of a little noise reduction, but still is interesting and could be even more dynamic if given more attention.</td>', 'I have to keep looking at this one...it is growing on me more and more each time I open it up.  I have to admit that on my first pass-through, I gave it a 3.  Now I''ve seen it about a dozen times, and have moved the score up to a 5 because I really like the angle and the light.  I think it does need more contrast and perhaps some curves adjustment, and that might lead to the need of a little noise reduction, but still is interesting and could be even more dynamic if given more attention.', '2006-10-27 19:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968976, 415447, 18349, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept but rather chopped and disjointed IMHO.  The framing at the bottom leaves the eyes wanting to see more outside the frame.</td>', 'Interesting concept but rather chopped and disjointed IMHO.  The framing at the bottom leaves the eyes wanting to see more outside the frame.', '2006-10-27 19:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969172, 416108, 58160, '<td valign="top">I''ve held off on voting on this for a couple days now trying to decide if a picture can meet challenge simply by the title.  It is a good picture, albeit a little dark for my preference and the floating highlight in the upper-left quadrant is a little distracting.  If there was something sports, or even game, related in the shot, I would have scored higher, probably a 6 or a 7, but after voting on everything else, I just can''t bring myself to do it.  4</td>', 'I''ve held off on voting on this for a couple days now trying to decide if a picture can meet challenge simply by the title.  It is a good picture, albeit a little dark for my preference and the floating highlight in the upper-left quadrant is a little distracting.  If there was something sports, or even game, related in the shot, I would have scored higher, probably a 6 or a 7, but after voting on everything else, I just can''t bring myself to do it.  4', '2006-10-27 20:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969175, 416681, 58160, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the contrast, but the bright light keeps yanking my eye away from the rest of the image.  For me, I suspect cropping landscape and only including the field, fence, and stands would have made the picture more successful.</td>', 'I like the colors and the contrast, but the bright light keeps yanking my eye away from the rest of the image.  For me, I suspect cropping landscape and only including the field, fence, and stands would have made the picture more successful.', '2006-10-27 20:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969184, 415450, 58160, '<td valign="top">A decent shot, but nothing in it really holds my attention.</td>', 'A decent shot, but nothing in it really holds my attention.', '2006-10-27 20:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969188, 413418, 16648, '<td valign="top">Does not meet the challenge.<br/>This may be an error on your part, accidents happen, but this site has subjects for challenges for a reason. Please play by the rules of the game.</td>', 'Does not meet the challenge.This may be an error on your part, accidents happen, but this site has subjects for challenges for a reason. Please play by the rules of the game.', '2006-10-27 20:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969189, 415447, 58160, '<td valign="top">The angle keeps nagging at me.  My mind wants the statue centered between the uprights, although I''m sure you would have been hammered for doing it.  Well done shot.</td>', 'The angle keeps nagging at me.  My mind wants the statue centered between the uprights, although I''m sure you would have been hammered for doing it.  Well done shot.', '2006-10-27 20:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
