(2969219, 413418, 58160, '<td valign="top">Beautifully shot, but I suspect this was entered in the wrong challenge, as it clearly doesn''t have anything to do with sports or games.  Had it not been so well done, I would have given it a 3, but you get a point for talent.  4</td>', 'Beautifully shot, but I suspect this was entered in the wrong challenge, as it clearly doesn''t have anything to do with sports or games.  Had it not been so well done, I would have given it a 3, but you get a point for talent.  4', '2006-10-27 20:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
