(2969230, 416783, 16648, '<td valign="top">The trees seeem to be the subject of the photo, as opposed to a the post-event sproting activity/venue, what have you. Sky at the top is blown out and I find that distracting, and i see no effort at any composition - no rule of thirds, no leading lines, no center of interest, no use of color, nothing.</td>', 'The trees seeem to be the subject of the photo, as opposed to a the post-event sproting activity/venue, what have you. Sky at the top is blown out and I find that distracting, and i see no effort at any composition - no rule of thirds, no leading lines, no center of interest, no use of color, nothing.', '2006-10-27 20:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
