(2969538, 416125, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is only loosely shoehorned in via a title.  I can understand the concept, but it''s a little vague at best without the title.</td>', 'This is only loosely shoehorned in via a title.  I can understand the concept, but it''s a little vague at best without the title.', '2006-10-27 21:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969543, 416785, 18349, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''re getting some DNMC comments/votes due to the people in the shot. The colors are a little off on my monitor; perhaps it''s the cloudy sky that makes it appear a bit blue.  The red pylons are also glowing, which is rather distracting.</td>', 'I''m sure you''re getting some DNMC comments/votes due to the people in the shot. The colors are a little off on my monitor; perhaps it''s the cloudy sky that makes it appear a bit blue.  The red pylons are also glowing, which is rather distracting.', '2006-10-27 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969550, 416931, 18349, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept...the shot''s composition seems a bit awkward to me.  I can''t really put my finger on it but it just seems too close to the center and yet just far enough away from the center to be awkward.  I am sure I''m babbling and it''s probably the cough syrup, but I am just making an observation.</td>', 'Interesting concept...the shot''s composition seems a bit awkward to me.  I can''t really put my finger on it but it just seems too close to the center and yet just far enough away from the center to be awkward.  I am sure I''m babbling and it''s probably the cough syrup, but I am just making an observation.', '2006-10-27 21:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969553, 416125, 66733, '<td valign="top">great idea !</td>', 'great idea !', '2006-10-27 21:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969554, 416124, 18349, '<td valign="top">This image is a bit uncomfortably framed for my tastes...the fence nearly divides the image in half horizontally, and the light in the far background on the right side is distracting my eyes.  The color seems a bit yellow to me but that could be my monitor.</td>', 'This image is a bit uncomfortably framed for my tastes...the fence nearly divides the image in half horizontally, and the light in the far background on the right side is distracting my eyes.  The color seems a bit yellow to me but that could be my monitor.', '2006-10-27 22:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969562, 416397, 18349, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, nice shot.  The shot seems to need a bit more contrast but that''s just a matter of personal taste.  The back end of the goal post is distracting but understandably avoidable in the image.</td>', 'Cute idea, nice shot.  The shot seems to need a bit more contrast but that''s just a matter of personal taste.  The back end of the goal post is distracting but understandably avoidable in the image.', '2006-10-27 22:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969567, 416297, 66733, '<td valign="top">Looks like he is still playing !</td>', 'Looks like he is still playing !', '2006-10-27 22:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969575, 413603, 66733, '<td valign="top">great shot, but the sky takes away from the field too much !</td>', 'great shot, but the sky takes away from the field too much !', '2006-10-27 22:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969578, 416108, 66733, '<td valign="top">neat picture, but other than the title... I''m not getting the game part !</td>', 'neat picture, but other than the title... I''m not getting the game part !', '2006-10-27 22:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969584, 416281, 18349, '<td valign="top">Love the matchstick pool cue.  Very creative and humorous.</td>', 'Love the matchstick pool cue.  Very creative and humorous.', '2006-10-27 22:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969586, 416783, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice color and composition; perhaps a closer crop on the left might be helpful.  The sky is blown out on my monitor, which is a little distracting.</td>', 'Nice color and composition; perhaps a closer crop on the left might be helpful.  The sky is blown out on my monitor, which is a little distracting.', '2006-10-27 22:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969587, 417028, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and location; I''d like to see less wall on the right and more bleachers on the left.</td>', 'Nice idea and location; I''d like to see less wall on the right and more bleachers on the left.', '2006-10-27 22:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969589, 415558, 18349, '<td valign="top">Good idea for the challenge.  Composition feels a bit cramped; would crop out the tiny bit of whatever that is along the bottom edge.</td>', 'Good idea for the challenge.  Composition feels a bit cramped; would crop out the tiny bit of whatever that is along the bottom edge.', '2006-10-27 22:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969592, 414488, 18349, '<td valign="top">I like the repetition in this shot; nice color and sharpness as well.  The white ice is a bit distracting, calling attention away from the seats.</td>', 'I like the repetition in this shot; nice color and sharpness as well.  The white ice is a bit distracting, calling attention away from the seats.', '2006-10-27 22:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969593, 417000, 18349, '<td valign="top">I think a bit of tilt to the camera would increase the dynamics of this shot immensely.  I also think that a black and white conversion might really bring out some of the cool textures in the shot.  Good concept.</td>', 'I think a bit of tilt to the camera would increase the dynamics of this shot immensely.  I also think that a black and white conversion might really bring out some of the cool textures in the shot.  Good concept.', '2006-10-27 22:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969594, 416300, 18349, '<td valign="top">LOL this is funny.  I wonder if it would be stronger if the table were turned counter clockwise a few degrees so that the entire background were the vertical blinds, losing the tree on the right, which is very distracting.  I''d also suggest losing some foreground and adding more on top, because of the neat lines and light from those blinds.  Nice black and white; could use some more contrast IMHO.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'LOL this is funny.  I wonder if it would be stronger if the table were turned counter clockwise a few degrees so that the entire background were the vertical blinds, losing the tree on the right, which is very distracting.  I''d also suggest losing some foreground and adding more on top, because of the neat lines and light from those blinds.  Nice black and white; could use some more contrast IMHO.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-27 22:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969595, 416858, 18349, '<td valign="top">It took more than a few moments to figure out what all the burgundy things were in the back of the image.  Voters typically only give images a cursory glance of a few seconds, and if it takes longer than that to "get" an image, you stand a good chance of receiving a bad score.  The concept of this shot is good, but its execution is lacking.  The image has a blue cast to it, making the colors a bit unrealistic on my monitor.  The composition of the image is very scattered and lacking a focal point when you take away the title.  I think that changing the perspective, i.e. squatting down instead of taking the shot from eye level, might have increased the power of the image.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It took more than a few moments to figure out what all the burgundy things were in the back of the image.  Voters typically only give images a cursory glance of a few seconds, and if it takes longer than that to "get" an image, you stand a good chance of receiving a bad score.  The concept of this shot is good, but its execution is lacking.  The image has a blue cast to it, making the colors a bit unrealistic on my monitor.  The composition of the image is very scattered and lacking a focal point when you take away the title.  I think that changing the perspective, i.e. squatting down instead of taking the shot from eye level, might have increased the power of the image.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-27 22:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969598, 414090, 16648, '<td valign="top">DNMC - i see a person...</td>', 'DNMC - i see a person...', '2006-10-27 22:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969602, 416228, 16648, '<td valign="top">DNMC - i see a person.</td>', 'DNMC - i see a person.', '2006-10-27 22:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969603, 416997, 18349, '<td valign="top">I can tell the field is lined up properly but the rise of the background makes it feel "off" or odd in some way.  I''d crop out a lot of the top area above the fence as well, since it doesn''t add to the composition.</td>', 'I can tell the field is lined up properly but the rise of the background makes it feel "off" or odd in some way.  I''d crop out a lot of the top area above the fence as well, since it doesn''t add to the composition.', '2006-10-27 22:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969607, 415029, 16648, '<td valign="top">A bit more depth of field would be nice. Color seems off - the white isn''t white, and overall contrast is a bit flat.</td>', 'A bit more depth of field would be nice. Color seems off - the white isn''t white, and overall contrast is a bit flat.', '2006-10-27 22:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969609, 416847, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice sky; love the angle.  The statues are a bit muddy looking and lack brightness/contrast.</td>', 'Nice sky; love the angle.  The statues are a bit muddy looking and lack brightness/contrast.', '2006-10-27 22:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969615, 415450, 16648, '<td valign="top">Nothing seems sharp. The tractory thing is suffering mostion blur, the extreme foreground is OOF from too shallow a DOF or perhaps the focus is too far back in the scene. i really don''t like the crop at the top.</td>', 'Nothing seems sharp. The tractory thing is suffering mostion blur, the extreme foreground is OOF from too shallow a DOF or perhaps the focus is too far back in the scene. i really don''t like the crop at the top.', '2006-10-27 22:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969617, 416402, 18349, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge well.  The bucket in the center distracts the eyes and pulls all the attention to it.  The benches on the right, and the rail of the stairs going down to the field on the right, also are distractions that interrupt the horizontal flow the repeating patterns had created.</td>', 'Meets challenge well.  The bucket in the center distracts the eyes and pulls all the attention to it.  The benches on the right, and the rail of the stairs going down to the field on the right, also are distractions that interrupt the horizontal flow the repeating patterns had created.', '2006-10-27 22:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969620, 417008, 18349, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot but the jacket hanging on the fence and the garden hose in the background are distracting in this particular composition.  I''d like to see a little more breathing room around the outsides of the frame, particularly to the right and along the top.</td>', 'I like this a lot but the jacket hanging on the fence and the garden hose in the background are distracting in this particular composition.  I''d like to see a little more breathing room around the outsides of the frame, particularly to the right and along the top.', '2006-10-27 22:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969621, 415144, 16648, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the lighting is bad - direct flash I suppose, but I don''t like it. The lighting calls too much attention to itself, and away from the items in the image.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the lighting is bad - direct flash I suppose, but I don''t like it. The lighting calls too much attention to itself, and away from the items in the image.', '2006-10-27 22:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969626, 416756, 18349, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of potential.  I like the angle and the composition, but I think the ball shoudl be placed a little more to the right or you could step a bit more to the left.  Just a matter of personal taste.</td>', 'This has a lot of potential.  I like the angle and the composition, but I think the ball shoudl be placed a little more to the right or you could step a bit more to the left.  Just a matter of personal taste.', '2006-10-27 22:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969630, 415416, 18349, '<td valign="top">Great place for a shot for this challenge.  I wish the shadows weren''t so harsh because you lose a lot of the great details in the venue.</td>', 'Great place for a shot for this challenge.  I wish the shadows weren''t so harsh because you lose a lot of the great details in the venue.', '2006-10-27 22:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969632, 416973, 16648, '<td valign="top">DNMC - i see people. I also don''t like the way you''ve bordered the image on the edges, and it''s not straight.</td>', 'DNMC - i see people. I also don''t like the way you''ve bordered the image on the edges, and it''s not straight.', '2006-10-27 22:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969640, 416756, 16648, '<td valign="top">Similar to an idea I had but did not find the time to shoot - mine invloved a soccer ball and night. I''d suggest moving the camera to the right a bit - i like the ball''s shadow but not the building in the back right. A bit less DOF would have helped some too - not too shallow, but just less.</td>', 'Similar to an idea I had but did not find the time to shoot - mine invloved a soccer ball and night. I''d suggest moving the camera to the right a bit - i like the ball''s shadow but not the building in the back right. A bit less DOF would have helped some too - not too shallow, but just less.', '2006-10-27 22:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969642, 416129, 16648, '<td valign="top">DNMC - i see a person.</td>', 'DNMC - i see a person.', '2006-10-27 22:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969645, 415182, 16648, '<td valign="top">DNMC - the challenge topic says ''after the people have gone home'', which implies no people are to be in the image.</td>', 'DNMC - the challenge topic says ''after the people have gone home'', which implies no people are to be in the image.', '2006-10-27 22:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969647, 415704, 18349, '<td valign="top">Great concept and image.  Love the motion blur.</td>', 'Great concept and image.  Love the motion blur.', '2006-10-27 22:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969651, 417021, 18349, '<td valign="top">I bet you''re just cringing at the basic editing requirements, wanting to get rid of that silly light pole in the background.  ;)  Good image, great color.</td>', 'I bet you''re just cringing at the basic editing requirements, wanting to get rid of that silly light pole in the background.  ;)  Good image, great color.', '2006-10-27 22:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969653, 414680, 18349, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of the challenge.  Great job at setting a mood with this image.</td>', 'One of my favorites of the challenge.  Great job at setting a mood with this image.', '2006-10-27 22:20:31.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2969654, 416000, 16648, '<td valign="top">Okaaaayyyy...you''re thinking out of the box. Too far IMO. I don''t get the connection to the challenge, and this being a visual medium your vision is not communicating to me. Sorry, but DNMC to me at this time. If I should ''get it'' i''ll come back and adjust my vote.</td>', 'Okaaaayyyy...you''re thinking out of the box. Too far IMO. I don''t get the connection to the challenge, and this being a visual medium your vision is not communicating to me. Sorry, but DNMC to me at this time. If I should ''get it'' i''ll come back and adjust my vote.', '2006-10-27 22:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969655, 415316, 18349, '<td valign="top">Now that''s something you don''t see every day.  At least not in Texas.  ;)  Good perspective and color.</td>', 'Now that''s something you don''t see every day.  At least not in Texas.  ;)  Good perspective and color.', '2006-10-27 22:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969657, 415814, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...I won''t even count off for sensor dust.  ;)  Pretty colors.</td>', 'Nice shot...I won''t even count off for sensor dust.  ;)  Pretty colors.', '2006-10-27 22:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969659, 416757, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors...beautiful scene.  I would like to see a bit more contrast and brightness in the grass in the foreground.</td>', 'Nice composition and colors...beautiful scene.  I would like to see a bit more contrast and brightness in the grass in the foreground.', '2006-10-27 22:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969660, 416297, 16648, '<td valign="top">DNMC - no sporting venue, and I see people (well, person) apparently playing a game, so again, it''s not meeting the challenge topic regarding ''after the game''. Cute image, but to get a 10 you gottta follow the rules.</td>', 'DNMC - no sporting venue, and I see people (well, person) apparently playing a game, so again, it''s not meeting the challenge topic regarding ''after the game''. Cute image, but to get a 10 you gottta follow the rules.', '2006-10-27 22:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969662, 416911, 18349, '<td valign="top">Another favorite of mine for this challenge.  Great color and composition.  Beautiful choice for the challenge.</td>', 'Another favorite of mine for this challenge.  Great color and composition.  Beautiful choice for the challenge.', '2006-10-27 22:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969667, 416681, 18349, '<td valign="top">Has almost a spy-like quality, sort of voyeuristic because of the bushes framing the image.  Nice depth-of-field.</td>', 'Has almost a spy-like quality, sort of voyeuristic because of the bushes framing the image.  Nice depth-of-field.', '2006-10-27 22:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969668, 416728, 16648, '<td valign="top">a bit flat in color and contast, as if underexposed a bit.</td>', 'a bit flat in color and contast, as if underexposed a bit.', '2006-10-27 22:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969669, 416755, 18349, '<td valign="top">I like the minimalistic feel of this image.  Great idea; hope the DNMC patrol isn''t after you.  :)</td>', 'I like the minimalistic feel of this image.  Great idea; hope the DNMC patrol isn''t after you.  :)', '2006-10-27 22:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969670, 415909, 18349, '<td valign="top">I like the duotone you have chosen to use here.  Very interesting and appealing image.  I do think the lower right side is a bit muddy and lacks contrast, but that aside, it''s still a good image for the challenge.</td>', 'I like the duotone you have chosen to use here.  Very interesting and appealing image.  I do think the lower right side is a bit muddy and lacks contrast, but that aside, it''s still a good image for the challenge.', '2006-10-27 22:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969671, 417011, 18349, '<td valign="top">Interesting image; would prefer a bit more contrast but that''s a matter of personal taste.  :)</td>', 'Interesting image; would prefer a bit more contrast but that''s a matter of personal taste.  :)', '2006-10-27 22:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969675, 415691, 18349, '<td valign="top">The railing in the center is a distraction throughout the image, IMHO.  Nice black and white subject, however, and is fitting for the challenge.</td>', 'The railing in the center is a distraction throughout the image, IMHO.  Nice black and white subject, however, and is fitting for the challenge.', '2006-10-27 22:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969681, 415068, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice shot for the challenge; I feel the sky needs a bit more drama to balance out the darkness of the parking lot.  Just a matter of personal taste I guess, plus it''s basic and not advanced, but it is just an observation.  :)</td>', 'Nice shot for the challenge; I feel the sky needs a bit more drama to balance out the darkness of the parking lot.  Just a matter of personal taste I guess, plus it''s basic and not advanced, but it is just an observation.  :)', '2006-10-27 22:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969683, 416198, 18349, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot...great color and composition.</td>', 'I like this image a lot...great color and composition.', '2006-10-27 22:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969693, 416728, 18349, '<td valign="top">The composition of this image really lacks a clear focal point...the flag and the scoreboard both being chopped off is confusing for the viewers.</td>', 'The composition of this image really lacks a clear focal point...the flag and the scoreboard both being chopped off is confusing for the viewers.', '2006-10-27 22:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969696, 416129, 18349, '<td valign="top">Great composition; hope the DNMC voters aren''t blasting you for the person in the shot.  Good color and clarity.</td>', 'Great composition; hope the DNMC voters aren''t blasting you for the person in the shot.  Good color and clarity.', '2006-10-27 22:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969922, 415316, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and centered comp works well with this shot.</td>', 'Nice perspective and centered comp works well with this shot.', '2006-10-27 23:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969936, 416297, 56658, '<td valign="top">dude was this taken in 1991?!:P you should upgrade your system. i actually really like the shot. i think the expression and pose work well. not a fan of the bottom left though.</td>', 'dude was this taken in 1991?!:P you should upgrade your system. i actually really like the shot. i think the expression and pose work well. not a fan of the bottom left though.', '2006-10-27 23:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969950, 416755, 36999, '<td valign="top">I would hae liked this more if the tennis ball didn''t have mud on it.  Very nice composition.</td>', 'I would hae liked this more if the tennis ball didn''t have mud on it.  Very nice composition.', '2006-10-28 00:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969973, 417000, 44490, '<td valign="top">Not a sporting venue.  But good composition, interesting lighting, just a bit more light on the pencil would help.</td>', 'Not a sporting venue.  But good composition, interesting lighting, just a bit more light on the pencil would help.', '2006-10-28 00:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970003, 414090, 44490, '<td valign="top">Looks like a player is still there.  Nice selective desaturation, I think that shallower DOF would give better isolation and blur out the grass distractions.  Also would like to see the whole foot.  Hope that it''s a prayer of thanks.</td>', 'Looks like a player is still there.  Nice selective desaturation, I think that shallower DOF would give better isolation and blur out the grass distractions.  Also would like to see the whole foot.  Hope that it''s a prayer of thanks.', '2006-10-28 00:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970015, 416000, 44490, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to make the connection to the challenge, but I''m still confused.  Interesting shadows, I think that more DOF to include the whole main whatever subject would help.</td>', 'I''m trying to make the connection to the challenge, but I''m still confused.  Interesting shadows, I think that more DOF to include the whole main whatever subject would help.', '2006-10-28 00:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970064, 416108, 44490, '<td valign="top">Sporting venue for an iron chef?  Looks like a nice dinner, nice arrangement, just probably a little too busy for DPC.</td>', 'Sporting venue for an iron chef?  Looks like a nice dinner, nice arrangement, just probably a little too busy for DPC.', '2006-10-28 00:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970076, 416954, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  This beat-up turf detracts from the shoes and doesn''t look very nice.  How about putting both shoes on the bench, and shoot from higher at the shoes on the bench so that the turf is not featured.</td>', 'Nice idea.  This beat-up turf detracts from the shoes and doesn''t look very nice.  How about putting both shoes on the bench, and shoot from higher at the shoes on the bench so that the turf is not featured.', '2006-10-28 00:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970108, 414488, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great idea, nice exposure and DOF, love the curved lines and seats all facing the main event behind the curved boards.  Love the shot, and that it fully meets the challenge.  Hope that it does well.</td>', 'Great idea, nice exposure and DOF, love the curved lines and seats all facing the main event behind the curved boards.  Love the shot, and that it fully meets the challenge.  Hope that it does well.', '2006-10-28 01:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970125, 416739, 44490, '<td valign="top">Not all the people have gone home yet.  Nice idea, unfortunately the gate grill kills this image.  DOF for more sharpness on the boy would help.  Maybe slightly left would be better, to reduce the dark central midground bleacher and show more bright background bleacher - difficult lighting.</td>', 'Not all the people have gone home yet.  Nice idea, unfortunately the gate grill kills this image.  DOF for more sharpness on the boy would help.  Maybe slightly left would be better, to reduce the dark central midground bleacher and show more bright background bleacher - difficult lighting.', '2006-10-28 01:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970130, 415182, 44490, '<td valign="top">The players haven''t yet gone home.  Nice vibrant blue uniforms and candid capture.  Shallower DOF would help to isolated foreground subjects and blur out background people more.</td>', 'The players haven''t yet gone home.  Nice vibrant blue uniforms and candid capture.  Shallower DOF would help to isolated foreground subjects and blur out background people more.', '2006-10-28 01:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970136, 415558, 44490, '<td valign="top">DOF and saturation for a clear colorful Michigan logo would be better, especially for a Michigan fan.  Some angle would help alleviate the blocky composition.</td>', 'DOF and saturation for a clear colorful Michigan logo would be better, especially for a Michigan fan.  Some angle would help alleviate the blocky composition.', '2006-10-28 01:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970173, 415543, 44490, '<td valign="top">Checkmate how?  And white''s king is already off the board.  Less clutter and better lighting would help, along with some angle.</td>', 'Checkmate how?  And white''s king is already off the board.  Less clutter and better lighting would help, along with some angle.', '2006-10-28 02:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970186, 415989, 44490, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the sporting venue...  I like the background pumpkin light bokeh.</td>', 'I don''t see the sporting venue...  I like the background pumpkin light bokeh.', '2006-10-28 02:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970188, 413603, 44490, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a lake than a sport venue like a golf course.  Nice tree line.</td>', 'Looks more like a lake than a sport venue like a golf course.  Nice tree line.', '2006-10-28 02:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970194, 413418, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great eyes and expression, but I see a person and don''t see a sporting venue - wrong challenge?</td>', 'Great eyes and expression, but I see a person and don''t see a sporting venue - wrong challenge?', '2006-10-28 02:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970206, 415814, 66192, '<td valign="top">Sensor is dirty! Otherise nice shot.</td>', 'Sensor is dirty! Otherise nice shot.', '2006-10-28 02:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970209, 417011, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice, careful perspective for a symmetrical shot.  I think that you should go the rest of th way towards a square crop, crop out the distracting roll up covers, and this would also give you more pixels for the center subject area.</td>', 'Nice, careful perspective for a symmetrical shot.  I think that you should go the rest of th way towards a square crop, crop out the distracting roll up covers, and this would also give you more pixels for the center subject area.', '2006-10-28 02:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970210, 416402, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, lines, meeting of challenge.  Unfortunately, the perpective is just too rectilinear for my taste, I''m wishing for some angle.</td>', 'Nice colors, lines, meeting of challenge.  Unfortunately, the perpective is just too rectilinear for my taste, I''m wishing for some angle.', '2006-10-28 02:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970212, 416397, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice markers and composition.  Just wish that it were sharper, did you not use a tripod for low light, allowing better ISO, less noise, etc.</td>', 'Nice markers and composition.  Just wish that it were sharper, did you not use a tripod for low light, allowing better ISO, less noise, etc.', '2006-10-28 02:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970216, 416929, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I''m wondering if you could match the title with a similar shot from  behind home plate, that would add more interesting details of the base line and batters box.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I''m wondering if you could match the title with a similar shot from  behind home plate, that would add more interesting details of the base line and batters box.', '2006-10-28 02:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970217, 416300, 44490, '<td valign="top">Ha!  I guess that you could say that the player has gone home - maybe heaven, I hope?  Funny ;-)  Nice leading line, but I''d prefer some angle to it rather than bisecting the image down the middle.</td>', 'Ha!  I guess that you could say that the player has gone home - maybe heaven, I hope?  Funny ;-)  Nice leading line, but I''d prefer some angle to it rather than bisecting the image down the middle.', '2006-10-28 02:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970218, 416846, 44490, '<td valign="top">All the people have not yet gone home.  Nice composition, nice and bright except that fill light would help the girl, a small reflector would provide good fill.  Closer focus on the girl would also help.</td>', 'All the people have not yet gone home.  Nice composition, nice and bright except that fill light would help the girl, a small reflector would provide good fill.  Closer focus on the girl would also help.', '2006-10-28 02:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970220, 415895, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, but given this board read-out, I don''t think that the players and people have gone home.  Wish for something more than just the scoreboard, at least something purple.  Go Huskies!</td>', 'Nice and sharp, but given this board read-out, I don''t think that the players and people have gone home.  Wish for something more than just the scoreboard, at least something purple.  Go Huskies!', '2006-10-28 02:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970222, 415744, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The post and net seem too much in-your-face, much less post and net would be better from more angle.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The post and net seem too much in-your-face, much less post and net would be better from more angle.', '2006-10-28 02:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970223, 416228, 44490, '<td valign="top">Not all the people have gone home yet.  But of course the person adds interest to an somewhat sterile sporting venue.  Nice low golden sunlight and shadows.</td>', 'Not all the people have gone home yet.  But of course the person adds interest to an somewhat sterile sporting venue.  Nice low golden sunlight and shadows.', '2006-10-28 02:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970232, 416129, 44490, '<td valign="top">All the people have not yet gone home.  Nice idea, I really like the image and story.  I think that I''d prefer a tighter crop, it would still preserve the story, but allow me to see some facial expression that I want to see.</td>', 'All the people have not yet gone home.  Nice idea, I really like the image and story.  I think that I''d prefer a tighter crop, it would still preserve the story, but allow me to see some facial expression that I want to see.', '2006-10-28 02:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970233, 416281, 44490, '<td valign="top">Ha, just too funny.  Nice arrangement, colors, made me laugh.</td>', 'Ha, just too funny.  Nice arrangement, colors, made me laugh.', '2006-10-28 02:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970234, 414424, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness, including alphabet.  Wish for some angle, with this composition, go ahead and crop out distracting tree and pole.</td>', 'Nice sharpness, including alphabet.  Wish for some angle, with this composition, go ahead and crop out distracting tree and pole.', '2006-10-28 02:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970235, 416681, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and overall composition.  Would be better without the distracting foliage.</td>', 'Nice colors and overall composition.  Would be better without the distracting foliage.', '2006-10-28 02:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970239, 414680, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice low perspective, just bring ball closer and crop out some of bottom.  Interesting light.</td>', 'Nice low perspective, just bring ball closer and crop out some of bottom.  Interesting light.', '2006-10-28 02:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970240, 415144, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, great arrangment and assortment of instruments.  Wish for softer lighting.  While I don''t quite think that the band left without their instruments, I like it.</td>', 'Nice idea, great arrangment and assortment of instruments.  Wish for softer lighting.  While I don''t quite think that the band left without their instruments, I like it.', '2006-10-28 02:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970243, 415993, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and execution.  Wish for more of the venue to meet the challenge more.</td>', 'Nice idea and execution.  Wish for more of the venue to meet the challenge more.', '2006-10-28 02:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970244, 415450, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good idea and execution.  Just wish for more sharpness, probably need a slightly faster shutter speed.  Nice color and texture.</td>', 'Good idea and execution.  Just wish for more sharpness, probably need a slightly faster shutter speed.  Nice color and texture.', '2006-10-28 02:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970245, 416386, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, good exposure for the buildings and trees in background to fit the title.</td>', 'Nice idea, good exposure for the buildings and trees in background to fit the title.', '2006-10-28 02:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970246, 416997, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice color, the composition is somewhat too rectilinear for my taste.  Looks like a velodrome, seems like it is just begging to be photographed down low at track level, with an image capitalizing on the curve and pitch of the track.</td>', 'Nice color, the composition is somewhat too rectilinear for my taste.  Looks like a velodrome, seems like it is just begging to be photographed down low at track level, with an image capitalizing on the curve and pitch of the track.', '2006-10-28 02:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970247, 415691, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice low perspective, good DOF.  A tighter crop toward the upper left would be better, eliminating the somewhat blank foreground step and the vertical cut of the handrails.  I also wonder if color would help.</td>', 'Nice low perspective, good DOF.  A tighter crop toward the upper left would be better, eliminating the somewhat blank foreground step and the vertical cut of the handrails.  I also wonder if color would help.', '2006-10-28 02:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970248, 415909, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, with illumination through the uprights.  The upright bisects the image, a tighter crop might help along with  perspective from further away?</td>', 'Nice idea, with illumination through the uprights.  The upright bisects the image, a tighter crop might help along with  perspective from further away?', '2006-10-28 02:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970250, 416728, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good idea to get both the scoreboard and flag, slightly less crop would probably be better, as both the scoreboard and flag seem cut.  Brighter levels would be better.</td>', 'Good idea to get both the scoreboard and flag, slightly less crop would probably be better, as both the scoreboard and flag seem cut.  Brighter levels would be better.', '2006-10-28 02:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970251, 416145, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, especially the track line curving around toward the sunset.</td>', 'Nice composition, especially the track line curving around toward the sunset.', '2006-10-28 02:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970252, 416847, 44490, '<td valign="top">The middle seems a bit busy/cluttered, and the water isn''t visible enough to add much.  I wonder about the perpective from between the horses on the left?  I like the building against the sky.</td>', 'The middle seems a bit busy/cluttered, and the water isn''t visible enough to add much.  I wonder about the perpective from between the horses on the left?  I like the building against the sky.', '2006-10-28 02:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970253, 415416, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good meeting of the challenge, especially given the lighting conditions.  I think that a tighter crop to show less of the park in shadow would help, as the brighter section clearly dominates over the shadowed section.  Lovely colors.</td>', 'Good meeting of the challenge, especially given the lighting conditions.  I think that a tighter crop to show less of the park in shadow would help, as the brighter section clearly dominates over the shadowed section.  Lovely colors.', '2006-10-28 02:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970254, 415447, 44490, '<td valign="top">Consider more fill on the statues, or else take them to complete silhouettes, and consider crank up the saturation and maybe levels from previous for a deeper blue sky.  You''re so close to symmetrical, that you might as well fully frame the statues instead of having the goal post line cut through the arm.  I do like the image, and think that it can be even better.</td>', 'Consider more fill on the statues, or else take them to complete silhouettes, and consider crank up the saturation and maybe levels from previous for a deeper blue sky.  You''re so close to symmetrical, that you might as well fully frame the statues instead of having the goal post line cut through the arm.  I do like the image, and think that it can be even better.', '2006-10-28 02:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970257, 417028, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, colors, good lighting on tropy case.  Crop out more of wall on right and maybe floor on bottom to give more pixels for the trophy case.  Take bulletin off of door temporarily and clutter off of floor.  I think that you found a story in a tough challenge.</td>', 'Nice idea, colors, good lighting on tropy case.  Crop out more of wall on right and maybe floor on bottom to give more pixels for the trophy case.  Take bulletin off of door temporarily and clutter off of floor.  I think that you found a story in a tough challenge.', '2006-10-28 02:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970261, 416505, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, field, trees, clouds, sky, nice angled lines.  A main subjject would help, maybe a slightly tighter crop to feature the stadium more.</td>', 'Nice colors, field, trees, clouds, sky, nice angled lines.  A main subjject would help, maybe a slightly tighter crop to feature the stadium more.', '2006-10-28 02:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970263, 414589, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, especially the wave-like lines in the upper left.  Overall image seems a bit dark, brighter levels for foreground would probably be an easy adjustment.</td>', 'Nice capture, especially the wave-like lines in the upper left.  Overall image seems a bit dark, brighter levels for foreground would probably be an easy adjustment.', '2006-10-28 02:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970266, 416753, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Crop out poles on left would be better, and consider slightly brighter levels.  I like it.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Crop out poles on left would be better, and consider slightly brighter levels.  I like it.', '2006-10-28 02:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970268, 416755, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, composition, color, shadow.  A newly flattened tennis ball might be better and brighter.</td>', 'Nice idea, composition, color, shadow.  A newly flattened tennis ball might be better and brighter.', '2006-10-28 02:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970269, 416982, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, composition, execution.  The ball looks unnatural, overprocessed, shiny, with overblown whites and reds.  I think that you could deepen the color in the sky a touch.  I like the image, and think that your perspective for the bench and fence is very good.</td>', 'Nice idea, composition, execution.  The ball looks unnatural, overprocessed, shiny, with overblown whites and reds.  I think that you could deepen the color in the sky a touch.  I like the image, and think that your perspective for the bench and fence is very good.', '2006-10-28 02:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970271, 416298, 44490, '<td valign="top">Buckeye fever!  Nice choice of venue, beautiful glass, light, shadows, should do well.</td>', 'Buckeye fever!  Nice choice of venue, beautiful glass, light, shadows, should do well.', '2006-10-28 02:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970274, 416289, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, good low perspective, deep DOF, sharpness, and colors.  Wish that the lights were less blooming in your face, but I think that the overall image is strong, including the tilted horizon, for once.  Hope it does well.</td>', 'Nice idea, good low perspective, deep DOF, sharpness, and colors.  Wish that the lights were less blooming in your face, but I think that the overall image is strong, including the tilted horizon, for once.  Hope it does well.', '2006-10-28 02:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970275, 417004, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, love the colors, yellow, blue shades, lines.  While I''m looking for something to catch my focus, this is an absolutely lovely abstract.</td>', 'Nice capture, love the colors, yellow, blue shades, lines.  While I''m looking for something to catch my focus, this is an absolutely lovely abstract.', '2006-10-28 02:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970276, 416239, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and exection, wonderful lighting.  I''d prefer a slightly tighter crop.  I like it.</td>', 'Nice idea and exection, wonderful lighting.  I''d prefer a slightly tighter crop.  I like it.', '2006-10-28 02:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970277, 416983, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice intense line of green, ethereal fog, good composition for placement of lights in frame, although they are quite in-your-face.  Interesting.</td>', 'Nice intense line of green, ethereal fog, good composition for placement of lights in frame, although they are quite in-your-face.  Interesting.', '2006-10-28 02:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970278, 415316, 44490, '<td valign="top">From where did all the clamshells come?  Playing ball there must have a new sound - crunch.  Interesting composition, lines, use WA, symmetry works here, nicely done.</td>', 'From where did all the clamshells come?  Playing ball there must have a new sound - crunch.  Interesting composition, lines, use WA, symmetry works here, nicely done.', '2006-10-28 02:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
