(2970841, 416129, 4210, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve already gotten alot of comments about this image not meeting the challenge. Other than that, the contrast of blue and red is really good - you have some bright vivid colours. The thing that kinda "bothers" me about this image is that the repeating pattern of chairs is not very visually interesting.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve already gotten alot of comments about this image not meeting the challenge. Other than that, the contrast of blue and red is really good - you have some bright vivid colours. The thing that kinda "bothers" me about this image is that the repeating pattern of chairs is not very visually interesting.', '2006-10-28 14:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
