(2970854, 416915, 4210, '<td valign="top">This image definately meets the challenge, but I think the use of the flash at night really hurts this image. Also, it doesn''t use the rule of thirds, which (while it''s not a hard, fast rule - there are definately times it should be broken) might have helped the composition here.</td>', 'This image definately meets the challenge, but I think the use of the flash at night really hurts this image. Also, it doesn''t use the rule of thirds, which (while it''s not a hard, fast rule - there are definately times it should be broken) might have helped the composition here.', '2006-10-28 14:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970855, 414589, 63244, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo.  Perhaps a touch dark for my taste, but it''s really nice.</td>', 'Very interesting photo.  Perhaps a touch dark for my taste, but it''s really nice.', '2006-10-28 14:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
