(2970862, 416300, 4210, '<td valign="top">DMNC. Other than that, I like the composition, and the use of black and white. Not sure why the paddle is on his back though, unless you meant to mean that he''d been "stabbed" with it...?</td>', 'DMNC. Other than that, I like the composition, and the use of black and white. Not sure why the paddle is on his back though, unless you meant to mean that he''d been "stabbed" with it...?', '2006-10-28 14:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
