(2981269, 416000, 63503, '<td valign="top">I get it now; this is a new french sport called ''the battle of the chromosomes''. The guy we are looking at is the losing dead chromosome, left alone in the rink next to the blood puddle, everybody else already left the venue. Chromosomes, we now know, remain in the standing position upon death. The only piece of the mystery yet to be solved pertains to the nature of that thing wrapped around the dead guy''s right (left?) thigh; I can''t wait to read opinions about it.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-01 01:28:28.</i></td>', 'I get it now; this is a new french sport called ''the battle of the chromosomes''. The guy we are looking at is the losing dead chromosome, left alone in the rink next to the blood puddle, everybody else already left the venue. Chromosomes, we now know, remain in the standing position upon death. The only piece of the mystery yet to be solved pertains to the nature of that thing wrapped around the dead guy''s right (left?) thigh; I can''t wait to read opinions about it.', '2006-11-01 01:24:01.000000', '2006-11-01 01:28:28.000000', 0),
(2981288, 416298, 62634, '<td valign="top">Fixed the Keystone issue, <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=421176" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/62634/thumb/421176.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/62634/thumb/421176.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/62634/thumb/421176.jpg"/></a> <br/>I would like to say I thought of that prior to the challenge and I didn''t do it due to basic rules but the comments here made me realized I could fix it.  The problem was that there was a stand in the middle of the opening or I could hav stepped back.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=421180" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/62634/thumb/421180.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/62634/thumb/421180.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/62634/thumb/421180.jpg"/></a> <br/>But NOW I realized I could have climbed on top of the stand and dramatically reduced the issue.<br/> <br/>I actually got into the stadium the morning after the game.  Got some good shots of trash on the field, cleaning crews with leaf blowers and a frat house with trash all over the lawn, but the weather was terrible and no PP was going to make the shots look good. <br/> <br/>Thanks again for the comments.<br/></td>', 'Fixed the Keystone issue,  I would like to say I thought of that prior to the challenge and I didn''t do it due to basic rules but the comments here made me realized I could fix it.  The problem was that there was a stand in the middle of the opening or I could hav stepped back. But NOW I realized I could have climbed on top of the stand and dramatically reduced the issue. I actually got into the stadium the morning after the game.  Got some good shots of trash on the field, cleaning crews with leaf blowers and a frat house with trash all over the lawn, but the weather was terrible and no PP was going to make the shots look good.  Thanks again for the comments.', '2006-11-01 01:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
