(2981530, 416281, 62095, '<td valign="top">WHAT?! 64th place? You have to be kidding me.  This was one of the best photos in the challenge.  gnarrgggg.  It is a sporting venue.  A sport is played on the snooker table, so it clearly meets the challenge. Ptish I say.</td>', 'WHAT?! 64th place? You have to be kidding me.  This was one of the best photos in the challenge.  gnarrgggg.  It is a sporting venue.  A sport is played on the snooker table, so it clearly meets the challenge. Ptish I say.', '2006-11-01 02:17:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2981550, 416300, 45566, '<td valign="top">Thanks Everyone, to address the DNMC thoughts... I know it was maybe stretching things a bit, but I was using the angle that a dead player, has ''gone home'' in a different way.<br/> <br/>I didn''t show it particularly well, but he was supposed to hve been clobbered across the back of the head with his opponents bat.</td>', 'Thanks Everyone, to address the DNMC thoughts... I know it was maybe stretching things a bit, but I was using the angle that a dead player, has ''gone home'' in a different way. I didn''t show it particularly well, but he was supposed to hve been clobbered across the back of the head with his opponents bat.', '2006-11-01 02:23:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2981553, 416298, 40430, '<td valign="top">Not that I am an Ohio State fan,  but I will root for them when they are the underdog and against them when they are the powerhouse that they are now. this image is better than mine and most others in this challenge. Maybe most couldn''t figure out it was part of the Stadium. I wonder if most are sports fans to the extent that the BIG 10 and SEC (me) football fans are sports fans even though there are an exceedingly large amount of great photographers here.  You was robbed.</td>', 'Not that I am an Ohio State fan,  but I will root for them when they are the underdog and against them when they are the powerhouse that they are now. this image is better than mine and most others in this challenge. Maybe most couldn''t figure out it was part of the Stadium. I wonder if most are sports fans to the extent that the BIG 10 and SEC (me) football fans are sports fans even though there are an exceedingly large amount of great photographers here.  You was robbed.', '2006-11-01 02:24:36.000000', NULL, 0),
