(2981764, 416000, 67483, '<td valign="top">Thkx everybody for voting,<br/> <br/>I finished last one but not least !<br/> <br/>theme explanation<br/>My little chromosome after the game of life has survived... The human evolution can take place and perhaps war will not be an answer anymore for human being ! Ok it was maybe a little far away from a classic theme approach, I should have make him running with a baseball glove !<br/> <br/>Thks again, and see you to the next challenge ;)<br/> <br/>PS : For Senor_Kasper, the thigh thing is... Some proteins doing some DNA fixing jobs in order to restore the DNA before replication. And, on the left of the photo, you can see a DNA fragment combing on the surface...<br/>Nature is so beautifull<br/> <br/>PS2 : "Petit à petit on devient moins petit..."<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-01 04:11:58.</i></td>', 'Thkx everybody for voting, I finished last one but not least ! theme explanationMy little chromosome after the game of life has survived... The human evolution can take place and perhaps war will not be an answer anymore for human being ! Ok it was maybe a little far away from a classic theme approach, I should have make him running with a baseball glove ! Thks again, and see you to the next challenge ;) PS : For Senor_Kasper, the thigh thing is... Some proteins doing some DNA fixing jobs in order to restore the DNA before replication. And, on the left of the photo, you can see a DNA fragment combing on the surface...Nature is so beautifull PS2 : "Petit à petit on devient moins petit..."', '2006-11-01 03:31:28.000000', '2006-11-01 04:11:58.000000', 0),
