(2998175, 416739, 19333, '<td valign="top">Thank you all who voted and commented. I knew it wouldn''t get far, but anyway I think the idea got transmitted. <br/> <br/>I agree with you all... except with the DNMC. Everyone has already gone home, the kid''s <i>just arriving</i>!! ;-)<br/> <br/>The pic was a quick and dirt shot in a hurry, nothing staged. Just told the kid to stand there and he did... for a couple seconds, you know how restles kids get ;). No second take or even time to put the flash in.<br/> <br/>I know the lightning is... difficult. I doubted about focusing on the kid, hence light him up, or the pavilion, and choose the pavilion as per the challenge description. Tried him to get just to a silhouette with very little detail.</td>', 'Thank you all who voted and commented. I knew it wouldn''t get far, but anyway I think the idea got transmitted.  I agree with you all... except with the DNMC. Everyone has already gone home, the kid''s just arriving!! ;-) The pic was a quick and dirt shot in a hurry, nothing staged. Just told the kid to stand there and he did... for a couple seconds, you know how restles kids get ;). No second take or even time to put the flash in. I know the lightning is... difficult. I doubted about focusing on the kid, hence light him up, or the pavilion, and choose the pavilion as per the challenge description. Tried him to get just to a silhouette with very little detail.', '2006-11-04 16:15:34.000000', NULL, 0),
