(3165587, 416198, 70791, '<td valign="top">I find the white spot on the pavement balanced out the white on the left side and also the brigh colored cups. I like the yellow strip dividing the photo a lot. I believe the box explains what the cups are more about than distracting. If you wanted a very clean photo they are distracting, but this photo itself is not clean with all the litter sitting around. I really like how it could be read as ''the drunk litter bugs of america'' in some funny way. ;)<br/> <br/>That''s just my opinion. I really enjoy this photo. Thanks!</td>', 'I find the white spot on the pavement balanced out the white on the left side and also the brigh colored cups. I like the yellow strip dividing the photo a lot. I believe the box explains what the cups are more about than distracting. If you wanted a very clean photo they are distracting, but this photo itself is not clean with all the litter sitting around. I really like how it could be read as ''the drunk litter bugs of america'' in some funny way. ;) That''s just my opinion. I really enjoy this photo. Thanks!', '2006-12-31 23:25:04.000000', NULL, 0),
